/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span><span>\\u00a0Full GSX Check report must show:<\\/span><br \\/><span>\\u00a0 \\u00a0- Next Activation Policy ID: 4000<\\/span><br \\/><span>\\u00a0 \\u00a0- Carrier: US Reseller Flex Policy<\\/span><br \\/><span>\\u00a0 \\u00a0- GSMA Status: Clean<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span><span><span>\\u00a0 \\u00a0* By using this service you recognize you have purchased this device and are the owner and is fully paid off.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span><span><span>ATTENTION:<\\/span>\\u00a0We do NOT support devices that are illegally acquired - This service is only supported for Clean Eligible devices that are whitelisted and obtained through legal methods. By using this service you agree to those terms and are held\\u00a0responsible for your IMEI\'s<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span><span><span>* Please verify the carrier prior to purchasing your unlock. Refunds are not available for incorrect carrier.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span><span><span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span><span><span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span><span><span>#shandy<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\",\"ADDITIONAL_NVP\":\"a:7:{s:11:\\\"imei_custom\\\";i:0;s:15:\\\"imei_custom_len\\\";i:0;s:19:\\\"imei_custom_min_len\\\";i:0;s:19:\\\"imei_custom_max_len\\\";i:0;s:17:\\\"imei_custom_label\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:23:\\\"imei_custom_information\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:20:\\\"imei_custom_validate\\\";i:0;}\",\"Requires.Mobile\":\"None\",\"Requires.Network\":\"None\",\"Requires.Provider\":\"None\",\"Requires.PIN\":\"None\",\"Requires.KBH\":\"None\",\"Requires.MEP\":\"None\",\"Requires.PRD\":\"None\",\"Requires.Type\":\"None\",\"Requires.Locks\":\"None\",\"Requires.Reference\":\"None\",\"Requires.UDID\":\"None\",\"Requires.SERIAL\":\"None\",\"REQUIRED\":\"\",\"sync_key_data\":\"imei_bulk:1|allow_verification:0|refund_available_not_found:0|service_available_24:0|unlock_guaranteed:0|no_refund_for_bad_data:0|w