(1121, 2, '618', 'Chimera License ', 'Chimera', 96.9000, NULL, '<p>Chimera Tool License allows you to service over 8000 models of top Android brands. Can be used without a dongle.</p>\r\n<p>While placing your order, please indicate your username registered at chimeratool website.</p>\r\n<div class=\"notification info\">\r\n<p>After the expiration you have to purchase it again, if you want to continue using ChimeraTool software.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-wrapper\"><strong>[ There is a 48 hours waiting period between PCs switching ]</strong></div>\r\n<p>If you need to change computers more frequently, we recommend choosing Chimera Tool Premium Dongle.</p>\r\n<h2 data-id=\"0-supported-phone-brands\">Supported phone brands</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Samsung</li>\r\n<li>Huawei</li>\r\n<li>LG</li>\r\n<li>Xiaomi</li>\r\n<li>Vivo</li>\r\n<li>Tecno</li>\r\n<li>Motorola</li>\r\n<li>TCL</li>\r\n<li>ZTE</li>\r\n<li>Infinix</li>\r\n<li>Lenovo</li>\r\n<li>Oppo</li>\r\n<li>HTC</li>\r\n<li>BLU</li>\r\n<li>Hisense</li>\r\n<li>Blackberry</li>\r\n<li>Nokia / Nokia Lumia</li>\r\n<li>Realme</li>\r\n<li>Blackview</li>\r\n<li>Ulefone</li>\r\n<li>Dodgee</li>\r\n<li>Oneplus</li>\r\n<li>Wiko</li>\r\n<li>Alcatel</li>\r\n<li id=\"register-username\">Meizu</li>\r\n<li>ASUS</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-id=\"1-how-to-buy\">How to Buy</h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Register at&nbsp;<a href=\"https://chimeratool.com/register\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>chimeratool.com</strong></a>&nbsp;(if you`re buying for the first time)</li>\r\n<li>Provide us with your username while placing an order.</li>\r\n<li>After your order is completed successfully, we will inform you about it via email</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h2 data-id=\"2-how-to-start-using-chimera-tool\">How to start using Chimera Tool</h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://chimeratool.com/en/download\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Download ChimeraTool software</a></li>\r\n<li>Run this software</li>\r\n<li>Log into the software using your username from the Chimera