(1122, 2, '2', 'Chimera Tool Credits', 'Chimera', 0.0970, '0-1 Instant', '<p><strong>Chimera Tool Credits&nbsp;</strong>are meant for servicing BlackBerry, Samsung, and LG phones* as well as purchasing Chimera Tool activations.</p>\r\n<p>Please&nbsp;<a title=\"Create Account\" href=\"https://chimeratool.com/register\" rel=\"nofollow\">register at chimeratool.com</a>&nbsp;and provide us with your Username while placing an order. We\'ll add credits to your account after the order is complete. As soon as credits are deposited on your account, we will send you an email.</p>\r\n<div class=\"notification info\">\r\n<p>Minimum order is 10 credits.</p>\r\n<h2 data-id=\"13-supported-os\">Supported OS</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Windows 7, 8, 8.1, 10, 11 32/64-bit</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>*The developer provides support only for those phones which are on the list of supported. Not all servicing features can be applied to some supported models, due to differences of hardware/software versions. You can find a complete list of supported models on the official product page.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>#shandy</p>\r\n</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '{\"SERVICEID\":2,\"SERVICENAME\":\"Chimera Tool Credits\",\"CREDIT\":\"0.0970\",\"INFO\":\"<p><strong>Chimera Tool Credits&nbsp;<\\/strong>are meant for servicing BlackBerry, Samsung, and LG phones* as well as purchasing Chimera Tool activations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Please&nbsp;<a title=\\\"Create Account\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/chimeratool.com\\/register\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">register at chimeratool.com<\\/a>&nbsp;and provide us with your Username while placing an order. We\'ll add credits to your account after the order is complete. As soon as credits are deposited on your account, we will send you an email.<\\/p>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"notification info\\\">\\r\\n<p>Minimum order is 10 credits.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-id=\\\"13-supported-os\\\">Supported OS<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Windows 7, 8, 8.1, 10, 11 32\\/64-bit<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>*The developer provides support only for those phones which are on the list of supported. Not all servicing features can be applied to some supported models, due to differences of hardware\\/software versions. You can find a complete list of supported models on the official product page.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>#shandy<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\",\"ADDITIONAL_NVP\":\"a:2:{s:13:\\\"hide_quantity\\\";i:0;s:13:\\\"quantity_rule\\\";a:4:{s:9:\\\"min_value\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:9:\\\"max_value\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:11:\\\"multiple_of\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:9:\\\"specified\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";}}\",\"TIME\":\"0-1 Instant\",\"sync_key_data\":\"\",\"service_type_price_data\":\"\",\"qry_range_credit_info\":[{\"from_range\":1,\"to_range\":19999,\"credit\":\"0.0970\"}],\"REQUIRED\":\"username\"}', '{\"CUSTOM\":null}', '2026-02-25 03:00:52', '2026-02-25 03:00:52'),
(1123, 2, '633', 'Chimera Tool Reseller Credits', 'Chimera', 0.0920, NULL, '<p>You can be a reseller of ChimeraTool after applying to be a reseller on this link https://chimeratool.com/#reseller-registration in your Dashboard</p>\r\n<p>In order for us to accept your reseller registration your website must meet the following criteria: </p>\r\n<p>- You must have a website where our prices and products are clearly displayed without the need for login. <br />- The website must mandatorily display the operator\'s contact information for inquiries. <br />- The website must clearly indicate the available payment options. <br />- If payment is not made in USD, it is necessary to ensure that the price of the product in USD is indicated. Thisamount must correspond to the consumer prices available in the chimeratool.com webshop.</p>\r\n<p>After this, you have to purchase a minimum of 20000 credits from any of our Distributors. There is no upper limit, but the same lower limit applies to every subsequent purchase too, not only the first purchase you make. Credits are non-refundable. Once you completed every step, we will manually review it and then if everything is correct we will approve your status for 4 months.</p>\r\n<p>You will find your API key here: https://chimeratool.com/#reseller-settings with which you can connect our products to your website.</p>\r\n<p>You will be able to make 8% profit on each sale.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '{\"SERVICEID\":633,\"SERVICENAME\":\"Chimera Tool Reseller Credits\",\"CREDIT\":\"0.0920\",\"INFO\":\"<p>You can be a reseller of ChimeraTool after applying to be a reseller on this link https:\\/\\/chimeratool.com\\/#reseller-registration in your Dashboard<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>In order for us to accept your reseller registration your website must meet the following criteria: <\\/p>\\r\\n<p>- You must have a website where our prices and products are clearly displayed without the need for login. <br \\/>- The website must mandatorily display the operator\'s contact information for inquiries. <br \\/>- The website must clearly indicate the available payment options. <br \\/>- If payment is not made in USD, it is necessary to ensure that the price of the product in USD is indicated. Thisamount must correspond to the consumer prices available in the chimeratool.com webshop.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>After this, you have to purchase a minimum of 20000 credits from any of our Distributors. There is no upper limit, but the same lower limit applies to every subsequent purchase too, not only the first purchase you make. Credits are non-refundable. Once you completed every step, we will manually review it and then if everything is correct we will approve your status for 4 months.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>You will find your API key here: https:\\/\\/chimeratool.com\\/#reseller-settings with which you can connect our products to your website.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>You will be able to make 8% profit on each sale.<\\/p>\",\"ADDITIONAL_NVP\":\"a:2:{s:13:\\\"hide_quantity\\\";i:0;s:13:\\\"quantity_rule\\\";a:4:{s:9:\\\"min_value\\\";s:5:\\\"20000\\\";s:9:\\\"max_value\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:11:\\\"multiple_of\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:9:\\\"specified\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";}}\",\"TIME\":\"\",\"sync_key_data\":\"\",\"service_type_price_data\":\"\",\"qry_range_credit_info\":[{\"from_range\":1,\"to_range\":9999999,\"credit\":\"0.0920\"}],\"REQUIRED\":\"username\"}', '{\"CUSTOM\":null}', '2026-02-25 03:00:52', '2026-02-25 03:00:52'),
