(1171, 2, '243', 'RBSoft Mobile Tool software license', 'infinity Box Products', 19.5000, '1', '1. <a href=\"http://www.infinity-box.com/support/?r=501\" target=_blank> Download software</a><br>\r\n2. Install software and register with your <b>username/userid</b><br>\r\n3. Enter your <b>username/userid</b> below<br>\r\n4. After your order become <b>COMPLETED</b> you will be able to use software<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>NOTE:</b> Software license linked to one PC so if you will change PC you have to contact support to move license to another PC !', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '{\"SERVICEID\":243,\"SERVICENAME\":\"RBSoft Mobile Tool software license\",\"CREDIT\":\"19.5000\",\"INFO\":\"1. <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.infinity-box.com\\/support\\/?r=501\\\" target=_blank> Download software<\\/a><br>\\r\\n2. Install software and register with your <b>username\\/userid<\\/b><br>\\r\\n3. Enter your <b>username\\/userid<\\/b> below<br>\\r\\n4. After your order become <b>COMPLETED<\\/b> you will be able to use software<br>\\r\\n<br>\\r\\n<b>NOTE:<\\/b> Software license linked to one PC so if you will change PC you have to contact support to move license to another PC !\",\"ADDITIONAL_NVP\":\"a:2:{s:13:\\\"hide_quantity\\\";i:0;s:13:\\\"quantity_rule\\\";a:4:{s:9:\\\"min_value\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:9:\\\"max_value\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:11:\\\"multiple_of\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:9:\\\"specified\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";}}\",\"TIME\":\"1 \",\"sync_key_data\":\"\",\"service_type_price_data\":\"\",\"qry_range_credit_info\":[{\"from_range\":1,\"to_range\":10000,\"credit\":\"19.5000\"}],\"REQUIRED\":\"SERIAL_NUMBER\"}', '{\"CUSTOM\":null}', '2026-02-25 03:00:52', '2026-02-25 03:00:52'),
