/div>\\r\\n<p>To Reset FRP lock using combination firmware, you can try to do the following:<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>I.<\\/p>\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n<li>Write \\\"boot.img\\\" partition from appropriate Combination firmware.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Perform \\\"Reset FRP ADB (Combination)\\\" operation in the software.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<p>II.<\\/p>\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n<li>Write full Combination firmware.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Go to \\\"Developer Options\\\" in the phone&rsquo;s Settings.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Check \\\"Enable OEM ...\\\" option.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Perform Factory Data Reset.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Reflash the phone with full stock (original) firmware.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<p><strong>Note<\\/strong>: \\\"boot.img\\\" from combination firmware can be not compatible with current phone\'s firmware. In that case phone will freeze on logo, or will be rebooting after writing of such boot. To restore the phone to its initial condition you need to reflash it with different full stock (original) firmware (or try to write only boot of such firmware).<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Also note<\\/strong>: You can write \\\"boot.img\\\" combination firmware or downgrade phone\'s firmware version only at your own risk!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>P.S. If you cannot find combination firmware for your model in &ldquo;SAMSUNG\\/COMBINATION\\\" folder in Support Area, this means we don&rsquo;t have these files at the moment. As soon as we get new combination firmwares, we will upload them into the Support Area.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-id=\\\"3--reset-frp-download-mode\\\">3. Reset FRP (Download Mode)<\\/h3>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"notification warning\\\">\\r\\n<p><strong>Be careful, performing this operation WILL DELETE all user data (contacts, pictures and other) from the device!<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<p>To perform the Reset FRP (Download Mode) operation, do the following:<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>1. Click \\\"Reset FRP (Download Mode)\\\" button.<br \\/>2. Put phone in Download Mode (power off the phone, press and hold &ldquo;Volume-&ldquo; + &ldquo;Home&rdquo; + &ldquo;Power ON&rdquo; buttons).<br \\/>3. Connect the phone to PC via Micro USB cable.<br \\/>4. Follow Software instructions (prompts).<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-id=\\\"4--reset-frp-uart-emmc-chips\\\">4. Reset FRP UART (eMMC chips)<\\/h3>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"notification info\\\">\\r\\n<p><strong>This operation WILL NOT reset\\/delete user data on the device.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<p>To perform the Reset FRP UART (eMMC chips) operation, do the following:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n<li>Click &ldquo;Reset FRP UART (eMMC chips)&rdquo; button<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Connect the phone to Box via UART cable<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Press and hold \\\"Vol-\\\" and \\\"Power\\\" buttons for 15-20 seconds<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Wait until software requests to connect USB cable<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Connect the phone to PC via USB cable. Software will read some data<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Connect again the phone to Box via UART cable<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Press and hold \\\"Vol-\\\" and \\\"Power\\\" buttons for 15-20 seconds<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Follow software instructions (prompts)<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<h2 data-id=\\\"5-reset-frp-for-huawei\\\">Reset FRP for Huawei<\\/h2>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"notification warning\\\">\\r\\n<p>Be careful, performing this operation may reset\\/delete all user data (contacts, pictures and other) on some devices and firmware versions! Software will inform you about this in log, so please read and follow software instructions (prompts) carefully!<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<p>To perform the Reset FRP operation, do the following:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n<li>Remove SD and SIM cards from the phone.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Put the phone in FastBoot Mode (power the phone OFF; press and hold &ldquo;Volume-&ldquo; button, insert USB cable and wait until the phone goes in FastBoot Mode).<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Install necessary driver.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Click \\\"Reset FRP\\\" button<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Follow software instructions (prompts).<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<h2 data-id=\\\"6-reset-frp-for-lg\\\">Reset FRP for LG<\\/h2>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"notification warning\\\">\\r\\n<p>&ldquo;Reset FRP&rdquo; operation. Be careful, performing this operation may reset\\/delete all user data (contacts, pictures and other) on some devices and firmware versions! Software will inform you about this in log, so please read and follow software instructions (prompts) carefully!<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<p>To perform the Reset FRP operation, do the following:<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>1. Remove SD and SIM cards from the phone.<br \\/>2. Put the phone in Download Mode (power the phone OFF, press and hold \\\"Vol+\\\" button and connect USB cable).<br \\/>3. Install necessary driver.<br \\/>4. Click \\\"Reset FRP\\\" button.<br \\/>5. Follow software instructions (prompts).<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-id=\\\"7-reset-frp-for-alcatel\\\"><strong>Reset FRP for Alcatel<\\/strong><\\/h2>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"notification info\\\">\\r\\n<p>This operation will not reset\\/delete device user data.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<p>To perform the Reset FRP operation, do the following:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n<li>Remove SD and SIM cards from the phone.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Install necessary driver.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Power the phone OFF and connect USB cable.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Click \\\"Reset FRP\\\" button.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Follow software instructions (prompts).<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<h2 data-id=\\\"8-reset-frp-for-motorola\\\">Reset FRP for Motorola<\\/h2>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"notification info\\\">\\r\\n<p>This operation will not reset\\/delete device user data.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<p>To perform the Reset FRP operation, do the following:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n<li>Put the phone in Factory Mode (power the phone OFF; press and hold \\\"Vol-\\\" + \\\"Power\\\" buttons; select &ldquo;Factory Mode&rdquo; in phone&rsquo;s menu and confirm selection; wait until the phone powers ON).<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Connect USB cable.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Install necessary driver.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Click \\\"Reset FRP\\\" button.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Follow software instructions (prompts).<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"notification\\\">\\r\\n<p>Reset FRP operation may not work for some devices with the latest Security patch level.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-id=\\\"11-package-contents\\\">Package Contents<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Activation Code for Octoplus FRP Tool<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p><strong>The product is digital - no packaging!<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>#shandy<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\",\"ADDITIONAL_NVP\":\"a:2:{s:13:\\\"hide_quantity\\\";i:0;s:13:\\\"quantity_rule\\\";a:4:{s:9:\\\"min_value\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:9:\\\"max_value\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:11:\\\"multiple_of\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:9:\\\"specified\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";}}\",\"TIME\":\"\",\"sync_key_data\":\"\",\"service_type_price_data\":\"\",\"qry_range_credit_info\":[{\"from_range\":1,\"to_range\":9,\"credit\":\"50.0000\"}],\"REQUIRED\":\"\"}', '{\"CUSTOM\":null}', '2026-02-25 03:00:52', '2026-02-25 03:00:52'),
(1186, 2, '639', 'Octoplus FRP Tool 1 Year Activation Renew for a Box / Dongle', 'Gsm Server Products', 22.0000, NULL, '<h2>Octoplus FRP Tool 1 Year Activation Renew for a Box / Dongle</h2>\r\n<p>This activation is intended to renew access to Octoplus FRP Tool software for the Octopus, Octoplus, or Medusa box and dongle users&nbsp;<strong>after 2 or more years from the initial activation date of the Octoplus FRP Tool software</strong>.</p>\r\n<p>Octoplus FRP Tool software allows you to service Samsung, Huawei, Xiaomi, LG, Alcatel, Motorola, and other cell phones.</p>\r\n<div class=\"notification info\">\r\n<p>Access for 1 year.</p>\r\n<h2 data-id=\"1-compatible-dongles-boxes\">Compatible dongles / boxes</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Octoplus Dongle</li>\r\n<li>Octopus Box</li>\r\n<li>Octoplus Box</li>\r\n<li>Octoplus Pro Box</li>\r\n<li>Medusa Box</li>\r\n<li>Medusa Pro Box</li>\r\n<li>Medusa Pro II Box</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-id=\"2-faq\">FAQ</h2>\r\n<p>Since its launch in 2017, Octoplus FRP Tool Activation did not require renewal. However, now renewal is necessary to help us improve the product and maintain high service quality. That said,&nbsp;<strong>renewing costs less than purchasing a competing tool annually</strong>, allowing you to stay equipped with the best solution while keeping your expenses minimal.</p>\r\n<h3 data-id=\"3-do-i-need-to-renew-my-access-now\">Do I need to renew my access now?</h3>\r\n<p>If you activated your Octoplus FRP Tool&nbsp;<strong>2 or more years ago</strong>, then yes, renewal is required.</p>\r\n<p>Here&rsquo;s a simple example to illustrate&nbsp;<strong>how it works</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Activated on or before March 6, 2023</strong>&nbsp;&rarr; Renewal required starting March 6, 2025</li>\r\n<li><strong>Activated on March 6, 2024</strong>&nbsp;&rarr; Renewal required starting March 6, 2026</li>\r\n<li><strong>Activated on March 6, 2025</strong>&nbsp;&rarr; Renewal required starting March 6, 2027</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-id=\"4-how-to-check-your-initial-activation-date\">How to check your initial Activation Date?</h3>\r\n<p>To check the initial activation date, run the Octoplus FRP Tool software, and it will display your Activation and Expiry date.</p>\r\n<p>*The developer provides support only for those phones which are on the list of supported. Not all servicing features can be applied to some supported models, due to differences of hardware/software versions. You can find a complete list of supported models on the official product page or the GSM forum.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>#shandy</p>\r\n</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '{\"SERVICEID\":639,\"SERVICENAME\":\"Octoplus FRP Tool 1 Year Activation Renew for a Box \\/ Dongle\",\"CREDIT\":\"22.0000\",\"INFO\":\"<h2>Octoplus FRP Tool 1 Year Activation Renew for a Box \\/ Dongle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>This activation is intended to renew access to Octoplus FRP Tool software for the Octopus, Octoplus, or Medusa box and dongle users&nbsp;<strong>after 2 or more years from the initial activation date of the Octoplus FRP Tool software<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Octoplus FRP Tool software allows you to service Samsung, Huawei, Xiaomi, LG, Alcatel, Motorola, and other cell phones.<\\/p>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"notification info\\\">\\r\\n<p>Access for 1 year.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-id=\\\"1-compatible-dongles-boxes\\\">Compatible dongles \\/ boxes<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Octoplus Dongle<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Octopus Box<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Octoplus Box<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Octoplus Pro Box<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Medusa Box<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Medusa Pro Box<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Medusa Pro II Box<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h2 data-id=\\\"2-faq\\\">FAQ<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Since its launch in 2017, Octoplus FRP Tool Activation did not require renewal. However, now renewal is necessary to help us improve the product and maintain high service quality. That said,&nbsp;<strong>renewing costs less than purchasing a competing tool annually<\\/strong>, allowing you to stay equipped with the best solution while keeping your expenses minimal.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-id=\\\"3-do-i-need-to-renew-my-access-now\\\">Do I need to renew my access now?<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>If you activated your Octoplus FRP Tool&nbsp;<strong>2 or more years ago<\\/strong>, then yes, renewal is required.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Here&rsquo;s a simple example to illustrate&nbsp;<strong>how it works<\\/strong>:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li><strong>Activated on or before March 6, 2023<\\/strong>&nbsp;&rarr; Renewal required starting March 6, 2025<\\/li>\\r\\n<li><strong>Activated on March 6, 2024<\\/strong>&nbsp;&rarr; Renewal required starting March 6, 2026<\\/li>\\r\\n<li><strong>Activated on March 6, 2025<\\/strong>&nbsp;&rarr; Renewal required starting March 6, 2027<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 data-id=\\\"4-how-to-check-your-initial-activation-date\\\">How to check your initial Activation Date?<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>To check the initial activation date, run the Octoplus FRP Tool software, and it will display your Activation and Expiry date.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>*The developer provides support only for those phones which are on the list of supported. Not all servicing features can be applied to some supported models, due to differences of hardware\\/software versions. You can find a complete list of supported models on the official product page or the GSM forum.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>#shandy<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\",\"ADDITIONAL_NVP\":\"a:2:{s:13:\\\"hide_quantity\\\";i:0;s:13:\\\"quantity_rule\\\";a:4:{s:9:\\\"min_value\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:9:\\\"max_value\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:11:\\\"multiple_of\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:9:\\\"specified\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";}}\",\"TIME\":\"\",\"sync_key_data\":\"\",\"service_type_price_data\":\"\",\"qry_range_credit_info\":[{\"from_range\":1,\"to_range\":10,\"credit\":\"22.0000\"}],\"REQUIRED\":\"\"}', '{\"CUSTOM\":null}', '2026-02-25 03:00:52', '2026-02-25 03:00:52'),
(1187, 2, '211', 'Octoplus Full 1 Year Digital License ', 'Gsm Server Products', 120.0000, '0-1 Instant', '<p><strong>Octoplus Full 1 Year Digital License</strong>&nbsp;combines all available licenses together:</p>\r\n<p>Some operation requires&nbsp;<strong>Credits</strong>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Credits Service also available on imei.us</strong></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"activate\" data-id=\"22-how-to-activate\">How to Activate:</h2>\r\n<p>Please follow these steps:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Download and install the latest version of the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://octoplusbox.com/en/download/software/\">Octoplus software</a></li>\r\n<li>Launch the software</li>\r\n<li>Use the received activation string to activate your digital license</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div class=\"full-img\"><img src=\"https://f00.psgsm.net/product/894336/octoplus-sams.jpg\" alt=\"Software\" /></div>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-id=\"0-general-information\">General Information:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>This license will be bound to your PC. No dongle or box is required.</li>\r\n<li>You can change a PC once per 48 hours (not more than 25 times during 1 year).</li>\r\n<li>The same license can be used on 2 PCs without switching limits.</li>\r\n<li>After the end of 1 year period you will have to buy this license again.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 id=\"samsung\" data-id=\"1-octoplus-samsung-license\">Octoplus Samsung License:</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Octoplus Samsung Digital License</strong>&nbsp;allows you to service Samsung cell phones.</p>\r\n<h3 data-id=\"2-main-features\">Main Features:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Decode</li>\r\n<li>Repair IMEI/Bluetooth</li>\r\n<li>Write Firmware</li>\r\n<li>Read/Calculate Codes</li>\r\n<li>Read/Write Full Flash</li>\r\n<li>Read/Write GDFS</li>\r\n<li>Flash via USB</li>\r\n<li>Read/Write/Repair NVM</li>\r\n<li>Read/Write/Repair EEPROM</li>\r\n<li>Edit Language</li>\r\n<li>Format FS</li>\r\n<li>Write/Repair Security</li>\r\n<li>Write Security Backup</li>\r\n<li>Factory Reset</li>\r\n<li>Hard Reset</li>\r\n<li>Read/Write/Repair TA</li>\r\n<li>Read Info</li>\r\n<li>Repair EFS</li>\r\n<li>Repair WiFi Address</li>\r\n<li>Reset Screen Lock/Pattern Lock</li>\r\n<li>Dump RAM/NAND</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 id=\"huawei\" data-id=\"17-octoplus-huawei-license\">Octoplus Huawei License:</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Octoplus Huawei Digital License</strong>&nbsp;allows you to service HiSilicon and Qualcomm CPUs-based Huawei devices.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Note!</strong>&nbsp;Huawei phones released after March 2018 with new security (except models supported via test point) are&nbsp;<strong>NOT SUPPORTED</strong>.<br />Please follow future updates for more information.</p>\r\n<h3 data-id=\"18-supported-operations-and-features\">Supported Operations and Features*:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Read Info</li>\r\n<li>Decode</li>\r\n<li>Read Bootloader Code</li>\r\n<li>Reset FRP</li>\r\n<li>Reset Huawei ID</li>\r\n<li>Factory Data Reset</li>\r\n<li>Repair IMEI A/B</li>\r\n<li>Repair Bluetooth MAC</li>\r\n<li>Repair Wi-Fi MAC</li>\r\n<li>Repair S/N</li>\r\n<li>Repair Board S/N</li>\r\n<li>Repair Vendor Code</li>\r\n<li>Repair Country Code</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-id=\"24-package-contents\">Package Contents:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Activation Code for Octoplus Full Digital License</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>* The developer provides support only for those phones which are on the list of supported. Not all servicing features can be applied to some supported models, due to differences of hardware/software versions.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>#shandy</p>\r\n<div class=\"yt-video -inside-dom\" data-video-id=\"SdbX7W2oWWs\" data-width=\"560\" data-height=\"315\">\r\n<div class=\"yt-video_container\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '{\"SERVICEID\":211,\"SERVICENAME\":\"Octoplus Full 1 Year Digital License \",\"CREDIT\":\"120.0000\",\"INFO\":\"<p><strong>Octoplus Full 1 Year Digital License<\\/strong>&nbsp;combines all available licenses together:<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Some operation requires&nbsp;<strong>Credits<\\/strong>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Credits Service also available on imei.us<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 id=\\\"activate\\\" data-id=\\\"22-how-to-activate\\\">How to Activate:<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Please follow these steps:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n<li>Download and install the latest version of the&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/octoplusbox.com\\/en\\/download\\/software\\/\\\">Octoplus software<\\/a><\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Launch the software<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Use the received activation string to activate your digital license<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"full-img\\\"><img src=\\\"https:\\/\\/f00.psgsm.net\\/product\\/894336\\/octoplus-sams.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Software\\\" \\/><\\/div>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-id=\\\"0-general-information\\\">General Information:<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>This license will be bound to your PC. No dongle or box is required.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>You can change a PC once per 48 hours (not more than 25 times during 1 year).<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>The same license can be used on 2 PCs without switching limits.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>After the end of 1 year period you will have to buy this license again.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h2 id=\\\"samsung\\\" data-id=\\\"1-octoplus-samsung-license\\\">Octoplus Samsung License:<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p><strong>Octoplus Samsung Digital License<\\/strong>&nbsp;allows you to service Samsung cell phones.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-id=\\\"2-main-features\\\">Main Features:<\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Decode<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Repair IMEI\\/Bluetooth<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Write Firmware<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Read\\/Calculate Codes<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Read\\/Write Full Flash<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Read\\/Write GDFS<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Flash via USB<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Read\\/Write\\/Repair NVM<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Read\\/Write\\/Repair EEPROM<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Edit Language<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Format FS<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Write\\/Repair Security<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Write Security Backup<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Factory Reset<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Hard Reset<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Read\\/Write\\/Repair TA<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Read Info<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Repair EFS<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Repair WiFi Address<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Reset Screen Lock\\/Pattern Lock<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Dump RAM\\/NAND<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h2 id=\\\"huawei\\\" data-id=\\\"17-octoplus-huawei-license\\\">Octoplus Huawei License:<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p><strong>Octoplus Huawei Digital License<\\/strong>&nbsp;allows you to service HiSilicon and Qualcomm CPUs-based Huawei devices.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Note!<\\/strong>&nbsp;Huawei phones released after March 2018 with new security (except models supported via test point) are&nbsp;<strong>NOT SUPPORTED<\\/strong>.<br \\/>Please follow future updates for more information.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3 data-id=\\\"18-supported-operations-and-features\\\">Supported Operations and Features*:<\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Read Info<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Decode<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Read Bootloader Code<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Reset FRP<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Reset Huawei ID<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Factory Data Reset<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Repair IMEI A\\/B<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Repair Bluetooth MAC<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Repair Wi-Fi MAC<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Repair S\\/N<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Repair Board S\\/N<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Repair Vendor Code<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Repair Country Code<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h2 data-id=\\\"24-package-contents\\\">Package Contents:<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Activation Code for Octoplus Full Digital License<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>* The developer provides support only for those phones which are on the list of supported. Not all servicing features can be applied to some supported models, due to differences of hardware\\/software versions.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>#shandy<\\/p>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"yt-video -inside-dom\\\" data-video-id=\\\"SdbX7W2oWWs\\\" data-width=\\\"560\\\" data-height=\\\"315\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"yt-video_container\\\">&nbsp;<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"ADDITIONAL_NVP\":\"a:2:{s:13:\\\"hide_quantity\\\";i:0;s:13:\\\"quantity_rule\\\";a:4:{s:9:\\\"min_value\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:9:\\\"max_value\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:11:\\\"multiple_of\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:9:\\\"specified\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";}}\",\"TIME\":\"0-1 Instant\",\"sync_key_data\":\"\",\"service_type_price_data\":\"\",\"qry_range_credit_info\":[{\"from_range\":1,\"to_range\":139,\"credit\":\"120.0000\"}],\"REQUIRED\":\"\"}', '{\"CUSTOM\":null}', '2026-02-25 03:00:52', '2026-02-25 03:00:52');
INSERT INTO `remote_server_services` (`id`, `api_provider_id`, `remote_id`, `name`, `group_name`, `price`, `time`, `info`, `min_qty`, `max_qty`, `credit_groups`, `additional_fields`, `additional_data`, `params`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(1188, 2, '481', 'Octoplus Full 3 Months Digital License', 'Gsm Server Products', 65.0000, NULL, '<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"prp_description\">\r\n<p><strong>Octoplus Full 3 Month Digital License</strong>&nbsp;combines all available licenses together<a href=\"https://gsmserver.com/en/octoplus-full-3-month-digital-license/#samsung\"><strong><br /></strong></a></p>\r\n<p>Some operation requires <strong>Credits</strong>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Credits Service also available on imei.us</strong></p>\r\n<h2 id=\"activate\" data-id=\"22-how-to-activate\">How to Activate:</h2>\r\n<p>Please follow these steps:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Download and install the latest version of the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://octoplusbox.com/en/download/software/\">Octoplus software</a></li>\r\n<li>Launch the software</li>\r\n<li>Use the received activation string to activate your digital license</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div class=\"full-img\"><img src=\"https://f00.psgsm.net/product/894336/octoplus-sams.jpg\" alt=\"Software\" /></div>\r\n<h2 data-id=\"0-general-information\">General Information:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>This license will be bound to your PC. No dongle or box is required.</li>\r\n<li>You can change a PC once per 48 hours (not more than 6 times during 3 months).</li>\r\n<li>The same license can be used on 2 PCs without switching limits.</li>\r\n<li>After the end of 3 month period you will have to buy this license again.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 id=\"samsung\" data-id=\"1-octoplus-samsung-license\">Octoplus Samsung License:</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Octoplus Samsung Digital License</strong>&nbsp;allows you to service Samsung cell phones.</p>\r\n<h3 data-id=\"2-main-features\">Main Features:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Decode</li>\r\n<li>Repair IMEI/Bluetooth</li>\r\n<li>Write Firmware</li>\r\n<li>Read/Calculate Codes</li>\r\n<li>Read/Write Full Flash</li>\r\n<li>Read/Write GDFS</li>\r\n<li>Flash via USB</li>\r\n<li>Read/Write/Repair NVM</li>\r\n<li>Read/Write/Repair EEPROM</li>\r\n<li>Edit Language</li>\r\n<li>Format FS</li>\r\n<li>Write/Repair Security</li>\r\n<li>Write Security Backup</li>\r\n<li>Factory Reset</li>\r\n<li>Hard Reset</li>\r\n<li>Read/Write/Repair TA</li>\r\n<li>Read Info</li>\r\n<li>Repair EFS</li>\r\n<li>Repair WiFi Address</li>\r\n<li>Reset Screen Lock/Pattern Lock</li>\r\n<li>Dump RAM/NAND</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 id=\"huawei\" data-id=\"17-octoplus-huawei-license\">Octoplus Huawei License:</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Octoplus Huawei Digital License</strong>&nbsp;allows you to service HiSilicon and Qualcomm CPUs-based Huawei devices.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Note!</strong>&nbsp;Huawei phones released after March 2018 with new security (except models supported via test point) are&nbsp;<strong>NOT SUPPORTED</strong>.<br />Please follow future updates for more information.</p>\r\n<h3 data-id=\"18-supported-operations-and-features\">Supported Operations and Features*:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Read Info</li>\r\n<li>Decode</li>\r\n<li>Read Bootloader Code</li>\r\n<li>Reset FRP</li>\r\n<li>Reset Huawei ID</li>\r\n<li>Factory Data Reset</li>\r\n<li>Repair IMEI A/B</li>\r\n<li>Repair Bluetooth MAC</li>\r\n<li>Repair Wi-Fi MAC</li>\r\n<li>Repair S/N</li>\r\n<li>Repair Board S/N</li>\r\n<li>Repair Vendor Code</li>\r\n<li>Repair Country Code</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-id=\"24-package-contents\">Package Contents:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Activation Code for Octoplus Full Digital License</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>* The developer provides support only for those phones which are on the list of supported. Not all servicing features can be applied to some supported models, due to differences of hardware/software versions.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>#shandy</p>\r\n<div class=\"yt-video -inside-dom\" data-video-id=\"SdbX7W2oWWs\" data-width=\"560\" data-height=\"315\">\r\n<div class=\"yt-video_container\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '{\"SERVICEID\":481,\"SERVICENAME\":\"Octoplus Full 3 Months Digital License\",\"CREDIT\":\"6