(1193, 2, '208', 'Octoplus Huawei 1 Year Digital License', 'Gsm Server Products', 60.0000, NULL, '<p><strong>Octoplus Huawei 1 Year Digital License</strong>&nbsp;allows you to service HiSilicon and Qualcomm CPUs-based Huawei devices.</p>\r\n<h2>General Information:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>This license will be bound to your PC. No dongle or box is required.</li>\r\n<li>You can change a PC once per 48 hours ( not more than 25 times during 1 year ).</li>\r\n<li>The same license can be used on 2 PCs without switching limits.</li>\r\n<li>After the end of 1 year period you will have to buy this license again.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Note!</strong>&nbsp;Huawei phones released after March 2018 with new security (except models supported via test point) are&nbsp;<strong>NOT SUPPORTED</strong>.<br />Please follow future updates for more information.</p>\r\n<h2 id=\"activate\">How to Activate:</h2>\r\n<p>Please follow these steps:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Download and install the latest version of the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://octoplusbox.com/en/download/software/\">Octoplus Huawei Tool Installer</a></li>\r\n<li>Launch the software</li>\r\n<li>Use the received activation string to activate your digital license</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div class=\"full-img\"><img src=\"https://f00.psgsm.net/product/894295/octoplus-huawei.jpg\" alt=\"Software\" /></div>\r\n<h2>Supported Operations and Features*:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Read Info</li>\r\n<li>Decode</li>\r\n<li>Read Bootloader Code</li>\r\n<li>Reset FRP</li>\r\n<li>Reset Huawei ID</li>\r\n<li>Factory Data Reset</li>\r\n<li>Repair IMEI A/B</li>\r\n<li>Repair Bluetooth MAC</li>\r\n<li>Repair Wi-Fi MAC</li>\r\n<li>Repair S/N</li>\r\n<li>Repair Board S/N</li>\r\n<li>Repair Vendor Code</li>\r\n<li>Repair Country Code</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Necessary Drivers</h3>\r\n<p>To install necessary drivers, install&nbsp;<a href=\"http://download-c.huawei.com/download/downloadCenter?downloadId=91283&amp;version=356266&amp;siteCode=worldwide\">&ldquo;HiSuite by Huawei&rdquo;</a>.</p>\r\n<h3>Manufacture Mode (for HiSilicon and Qualcomm CPUs-based devices):</h3>\r\n<p>To enable Manufacture Mode type #*#2846579#*#, then go to Project Menu &gt; Background Settings &gt; USB Port Settings &gt; Manufacture Mode.</p>\r\n<h3>Fastboot Mode:</h3>\r\n<p>To enable Fastboot Mode, do the following steps:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Turn off the phone. Remove SD and SIM cards</li>\r\n<li>Press \"Vol-\" and insert USB cable</li>\r\n<li>Wait until phone enters into Fastboot Mode</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3>How to connect devices:</h3>\r\n<p>To connect the device, do the following steps:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Install necessary drivers</li>\r\n<li>Press &ldquo;Auto detect&rdquo; button</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>or</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Install necessary drivers</li>\r\n<li>Check &ldquo;Manual select&rdquo; option</li>\r\n<li>Select proper model from the list in the Software</li>\r\n<li>Press &ldquo;Connect&rdquo; button</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div class=\"widget_product_octopus-models\">\r\n<h2>Package Contents:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Activation Code for Octoplus Huawei Digital License</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>#shandy</p>\r\n</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '{\"SERVICEID\":208,\"SERVICENAME\":\"Octoplus Huawei 1 Year Digital License\",\"CREDIT\":\"60.0000\",\"INFO\":\"<p><strong>Octoplus Huawei 1 Year Digital License<\\/strong>&nbsp;allows you to service HiSilicon and Qualcomm CPUs-based Huawei devices.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>General Information:<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>This license will be bound to your PC. No dongle or box is required.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>You can change a PC once per 48 hours ( not more than 25 times during 1 year ).<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>The same license can be used on 2 PCs without switching limits.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>After the end of 1 year period you will have to buy this license again.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p><strong>Note!<\\/strong>&nbsp;Huawei phones released after March 2018 with new security (except models supported via test point) are&nbsp;<strong>NOT SUPPORTED<\\/strong>.<br \\/>Please follow future updates for more information.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 id=\\\"activate\\\">How to Activate:<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Please follow these steps:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n<li>Download and install the latest version of the&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/octoplusbox.com\\/en\\/download\\/software\\/\\\">Octoplus Huawei Tool Installer<\\/a><\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Launch the software<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Use the received activation string to activate your digital license<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"full-img\\\"><img src=\\\"https:\\/\\/f00.psgsm.net\\/product\\/894295\\/octoplus-huawei.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Software\\\" \\/><\\/div>\\r\\n<h2>Supported Operations and Features*:<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Read Info<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Decode<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Read Bootloader Code<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Reset FRP<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Reset Huawei ID<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Factory Data Reset<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Repair IMEI A\\/B<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Repair Bluetooth MAC<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Repair Wi-Fi MAC<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Repair S\\/N<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Repair Board S\\/N<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Repair Vendor Code<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Repair Country Code<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3>Necessary Drivers<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>To install necessary drivers, install&nbsp;<a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/download-c.huawei.com\\/download\\/downloadCenter?downloadId=91283&amp;version=356266&amp;siteCode=worldwide\\\">&ldquo;HiSuite by Huawei&rdquo;<\\/a>.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3>Manufacture Mode (for HiSilicon and Qualcomm CPUs-based devices):<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>To enable Manufacture Mode type #*#2846579#*#, then go to Project Menu &gt; Background Settings &gt; USB Port Settings &gt; Manufacture Mode.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3>Fastboot Mode:<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>To enable Fastboot Mode, do the following steps:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n<li>Turn off the phone. Remove SD and SIM cards<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Press \\\"Vol-\\\" and insert USB cable<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Wait until phone enters into Fastboot Mode<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<h3>How to connect devices:<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>To connect the device, do the following steps:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n<li>Install necessary drivers<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Press &ldquo;Auto detect&rdquo; button<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<p>or<\\/p>\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n<li>Install necessary drivers<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Check &ldquo;Manual select&rdquo; option<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Select proper model from the list in the Software<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Press &ldquo;Connect&rdquo; button<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"widget_product_octopus-models\\\">\\r\\n<h2>Package Contents:<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Activation Code for Octoplus Huawei Digital License<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>#shandy<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\",\"ADDITIONAL_NVP\":\"a:2:{s:13:\\\"hide_quantity\\\";i:0;s:13:\\\"quantity_rule\\\";a:4:{s:9:\\\"min_value\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:9:\\\"max_value\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:11:\\\"multiple_of\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:9:\\\"specified\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";}}\",\"TIME\":\"\",\"sync_key_data\":\"\",\"service_type_price_data\":\"\",\"qry_range_credit_info\":[{\"from_range\":1,\"to_range\":99,\"credit\":\"60.0000\"}],\"REQUIRED\":\"\"}', '{\"CUSTOM\":null}', '2026-02-25 03:00:52', '2026-02-25 03:00:52');
INSERT INTO `remote_server_services` (`id`, `api_provider_id`, `remote_id`, `name`, `group_name`, `price`, `time`, `info`, `min_qty`, `max_qty`, `credit_groups`, `additional_fields`, `additional_data`, `params`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(1194, 2, '478', 'Octoplus Huawei 3 Month Digital License', 'Gsm Server Products', 30.0000, '1 Instant', '<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-12\">\r\n<div class=\"prp_description\">\r\n<p><strong>Octoplus Huawei 3 Month Digital License</strong>&nbsp;allows you to service HiSilicon and Qualcomm CPUs-based Huawei devices.</p>\r\n<div class=\"yt-video -inside-dom\" data-video-id=\"SdbX7W2oWWs\" data-width=\"560\" data-height=\"315\">\r\n<div class=\"yt-video_container\">\r\n<h2 id=\"activate\" data-id=\"8-how-to-activate\">How to Activate:</h2>\r\n<p>Please follow these steps:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Download and install the latest version of the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://octoplusbox.com/en/download/software/\">Octoplus Huawei Tool Installer</a></li>\r\n<li>Launch the software</li>\r\n<li>Use the received activation string to activate your digital license</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div class=\"full-img\"><img src=\"https://f00.psgsm.net/product/894295/octoplus-huawei.jpg\" alt=\"Software\" /></div>\r\n<h2 data-id=\"0-general-information\">&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<h2 data-id=\"0-general-information\">General Information:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>This license will be bound to your PC. No dongle or box is required.</li>\r\n<li>You can change a PC once per 48 hours (not more than 6 times during 3 months).</li>\r\n<li>The same license can be used on 2 PCs without switching limits.</li>\r\n<li>After the end of 3 month period you will have to buy this license again.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Note!</strong>&nbsp;Huawei phones released after March 2018 with new security (except models supported via test point) are&nbsp;<strong>NOT SUPPORTED</strong>.<br />Please follow future updates for more information.</p>\r\n<h2 data-id=\"1-supported-operations-and-features\">Supported Operations and Features*:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Read Info</li>\r\n<li>Decode</li>\r\n<li>Read Bootloader Code</li>\r\n<li>Reset FRP</li>\r\n<li>Reset Huawei ID</li>\r\n<li>Factory Data Reset</li>\r\n<li>Repair IMEI A/B</li>\r\n<li>Repair Bluetooth MAC</li>\r\n<li>Repair Wi-Fi MAC</li>\r\n<li>Repair S/N</li>\r\n<li>Repair Board S/N</li>\r\n<li>Repair Vendor Code</li>\r\n<li>Repair Country Code</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-id=\"2-necessary-drivers\">Necessary Drivers</h3>\r\n<p>To install necessary drivers, install&nbsp;<a href=\"http://download-c.huawei.com/download/downloadCenter?downloadId=91283&amp;version=356266&amp;siteCode=worldwide\">&ldquo;HiSuite by Huawei&rdquo;</a>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-id=\"3-manufacture-mode-for-hisilicon-and-qualcomm-cpus-based-devices\">Manufacture Mode (for HiSilicon and Qualcomm CPUs-based devices):</h3>\r\n<p>To enable Manufacture Mode type #*#2846579#*#, then go to Project Menu &gt; Background Settings &gt; USB Port Settings &gt; Manufacture Mode.</p>\r\n<h3 data-id=\"4-fastboot-mode\">Fastboot Mode:</h3>\r\n<p>To enable Fastboot Mode, do the following steps:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Turn off the phone. Remove SD and SIM cards</li>\r\n<li>Press \"Vol-\" and insert USB cable</li>\r\n<li>Wait until phone enters into Fastboot Mode</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-id=\"5-how-to-connect-devices\">How to connect devices:</h3>\r\n<p>To connect the device, do the following steps:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Install necessary drivers</li>\r\n<li>Press &ldquo;Auto detect&rdquo; button</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>or</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Install necessary drivers</li>\r\n<li>Check &ldquo;Manual select&rdquo; option</li>\r\n<li>Select proper model from the list in the Software</li>\r\n<li>Press &ldquo;Connect&rdquo; button</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div class=\"widget_product_octopus-models\">\r\n<div class=\"widget_product_octopus-models\">\r\n<h2 data-id=\"6-supported-features-and-phones\">Supported features and phones</h2>\r\n<h3 class=\"brand-title\" data-id=\"7-huawei\">Huawei:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Huawei:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span class=\"series-title\">ABR:</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">AL00</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"series-title\">ANE:</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">AL00T</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">L01</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">LX</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"series-title\">AQM:</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">AL00</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">AL10</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">TL00</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"series-title\">ARE:</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">AL00</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">AL10</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">L22HN</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">L32</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">LX2</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">TL00</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"series-title\">ARS:</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">AL00</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">AL10</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">L22</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">TL00</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"series-title\">ART:</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">AL00X</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">L28</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">TL00X</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"series-title\">BAL:</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">AL00</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">L49</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"series-title\">CAG:</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">L02</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">L02 (MTK MT6737)</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">L03</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">L03 (MTK MT6737)</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">L22</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">L22 (MTK MT6737)</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">L23</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">L23 (MTK MT6737)</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"series-title\">CHE1:</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">CL10 (HiSilicon Kirin 620)</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">CL20 (HiSilicon Kirin 620)</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">L04 (HiSilicon Kirin 620)</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"series-title\">CHE2:</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">L03 (HiSilicon Kirin 620)</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">L11 (HiSilicon Kirin 620)</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">L12 (HiSilicon Kirin 620)</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"tooltip\">L23 (Hi