(1202, 2, '205', 'Octoplus Samsung Digital 6 Month License', 'Gsm Server Products', 50.0000, NULL, '<p><strong>Octoplus Samsung 6 Month Digital License</strong>&nbsp;allows you to service Samsung cell phones.</p>\r\n<h2>General Information:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>This license will be bound to your PC. No dongle or box is required.</li>\r\n<li>PC can be changed once per 48 hours (during the COVID-19 period)<br />When things will get back to normal, this time will be increased up to 72 hours.</li>\r\n<li>After the end of 6 month period you will have to buy this license again.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '{\"SERVICEID\":205,\"SERVICENAME\":\"Octoplus Samsung Digital 6 Month License\",\"CREDIT\":\"50.0000\",\"INFO\":\"<p><strong>Octoplus Samsung 6 Month Digital License<\\/strong>&nbsp;allows you to service Samsung cell phones.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>General Information:<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>This license will be bound to your PC. No dongle or box is required.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>PC can be changed once per 48 hours (during the COVID-19 period)<br \\/>When things will get back to normal, this time will be increased up to 72 hours.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>After the end of 6 month period you will have to buy this license again.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\",\"ADDITIONAL_NVP\":\"a:2:{s:13:\\\"hide_quantity\\\";i:0;s:13:\\\"quantity_rule\\\";a:4:{s:9:\\\"min_value\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:9:\\\"max_value\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:11:\\\"multiple_of\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:9:\\\"specified\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";}}\",\"TIME\":\"\",\"sync_key_data\":\"\",\"service_type_price_data\":\"\",\"qry_range_credit_info\":[{\"from_range\":1,\"to_range\":49,\"credit\":\"50.0000\"}],\"REQUIRED\":\"\"}', '{\"CUSTOM\":null}', '2026-02-25 03:00:52', '2026-02-25 03:00:52'),
(1203, 2, '908', 'Octoplus Samsung Tool 1 Year Activation Renew for a Box / Dongle', 'Gsm Server Products', 22.7500, NULL, '<h2>Octoplus Samsung Tool 1 Year Activation Renew for a Box / Dongle</h2>\r\n<p>This activation is intended to renew access to Octoplus Samsung Tool software for the Octopus, Octoplus, or Medusa box and dongle users&nbsp;<strong>after 2 or more years from the initial activation date of the Octoplus Samsung Tool software.</strong></p>\r\n<p>Octoplus Samsung Tool software allows you to Decode, Write Firmware, Repair IMEI, and perform many other service operations on Samsung smartphones.</p>\r\n<div class=\"notification info\">\r\n<p>Access for 1 year.</p>\r\n<h2>How to activate</h2>\r\n<p>When we confirm your payment and process your order, we will send the&nbsp;<strong>activation code</strong>&nbsp;and detailed instructions to your email.</p>\r\n<h2>Compatible dongles / boxes</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Octoplus Dongle</li>\r\n<li>Octopus Box</li>\r\n<li>Octoplus Box</li>\r\n<li>Octoplus Pro Box</li>\r\n<li>Medusa Box</li>\r\n<li>Medusa Pro Box</li>\r\n<li>Medusa Pro II Box</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>If you don`t have any of these boxes or dongles, you can get access to Octoplus software using octoplus digital license.</p>\r\n<p>*The developer provides support only for those phones which are on the list of supported. Not all servicing features can be applied to some supported models, due to differences of hardware/software versions. You can find a complete list of supported models on the official product page or the GSM forum.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>#shandy&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\r\n</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '{\"SERVICEID\":908,\"SERVICENAME\":\"Octoplus Samsung Tool 1 Year Activation Renew for a Box \\/ Dongle\",\"CREDIT\":\"22.7500\",\"INFO\":\"<h2>Octoplus Samsung Tool 1 Year Activation Renew for a Box \\/ Dongle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>This activation is intended to renew access to Octoplus Samsung Tool software 