(1206, 2, '8', 'Octopus/Octoplus Server Credits', 'Gsm Server Products', 0.1050, NULL, '<h2>Octopus/Octoplus Server Credits Consumption</h2>\r\n<p>1 old credit = 10 new credits&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div class=\"notification info\">\r\n<p><strong>Octoplus Server Credits</strong>&nbsp;allow you to Decode Samsung, Decode, Remove FRP, Repair IMEI on LG phones (including ATT, TMB, SPR, Crcket models).</p>\r\n<p>Factory FRP service is offline! Free of charge FRP offline method is available for many US models and QC models via EDL (<a href=\"https://octoplusbox.com/en/news/octoplus-samsung-tool-software-v-4-2-8-is-out/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">check full supported models list</a>) and many MTK models via Download Mode (<a href=\"https://octoplusbox.com/en/news/octoplus-samsung-tool-software-v-4-2-7-is-out/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">check full supported models list</a>)</p>\r\n<h2 id=\"credit-issues\">Server Credits Issues:</h2>\r\n<p>Server credits issues, like credits loss, double charge must be reported as soon as possible to the following e-mail:&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:claim@octopusbox.com\">claim@octopusbox.com</a>, but&nbsp;<strong>not later than 7 days after operation has been performed</strong>.</p>\r\n<p>Issue report must contain:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Log files</li>\r\n<li>Box serial number</li>\r\n<li>Octoplus Server Credits account username</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Be aware that outdated claims will be declined.</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>#shandy</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p><strong><a href=\"http://gsmserver.com./item/credits-and-activations/server-credits/\"><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\" /><br /></a></strong></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '{\"SERVICEID\":8,\"SERVICENAME\":\"Octopus\\/Octoplus Server Credits\",\"CREDIT\":\"0.1050\",\"INFO\":\"<h2>Octopus\\/Octoplus Server Credits Consumption<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>1 old credit = 10 new credits&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"notification info\\\">\\r\\n<p><strong>Octoplus Server Credits<\\/strong>&nbsp;allow you to Decode Samsung, Decode, Remove FRP, Repair IMEI on LG phones (including ATT, TMB, SPR, Crcket models).<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Factory FRP service is offline! Free of charge FRP offline method is available for many US models and QC models via EDL (<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/octoplusbox.com\\/en\\/news\\/octoplus-samsung-tool-software-v-4-2-8-is-out\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">check full supported models list<\\/a>) and many MTK models via Download Mode (<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/octoplusbox.com\\/en\\/news\\/octoplus-samsung-tool-software-v-4-2-7-is-out\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">check full supported models list<\\/a>)<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 id=\\\"credit-issues\\\">Server Credits Issues:<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Server credits issues, like credits loss, double charge must be reported as soon as possible to the following e-mail:&nbsp;<a href=\\\"mailto:claim@octopusbox.com\\\">claim@octopusbox.com<\\/a>, but&nbsp;<strong>not later than 7 days after operation has been performed<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Issue report must contain:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Log files<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Box serial number<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Octoplus Server Credits account username<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p><strong>Be aware that outdated claims will be declined.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>#shandy<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<p><strong><a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/gsmserver.com.\\/item\\/credits-and-activations\\/server-credits\\/\\\"><br class=\\\"Apple-interchange-newline\\\" \\/><br \\/><\\/a><\\/strong><\\/p>\",\"ADDITIONAL_NVP\":\"a:2:{s:13:\\\"hide_quantity\\\";i:0;s:13:\\\"quantity_rule\\\";a:4:{s:9:\\\"min_value\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:9:\\\"max_value\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:11:\\\"multiple_of\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:9:\\\"specified\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";}}\",\"TIME\":\"\",\"sync_key_data\":\"\",\"service_type_price_data\":\"\",\"qry_range_credit_info\":[{\"from_range\":1,\"to_range\":5000,\"credit\":\"0.1300\"}],\"REQUIRED\":