(1207, 2, '637', 'Sigma Plus 1 Month License ', 'Gsm Server Products', 39.0000, '0-1 Instant', '<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Sigma Plus Licenses Now Available for Purchase!</h2>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Great news! You can now use Sigma Plus software without a box or dongle!</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Sigma Plus License is a fully digital version of our product that doesn\'t require a box or dongle. After instant activation, you get access to the full functionality of Sigma Plus.</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">How to buy and activate a Sigma Plus license:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">First, create an account on our website (<a href=\"https://license.sigmakey.com/auth/login\">link</a>).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Download and install the Sigma Plus software</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Log in to Sigma Plus using the email and password for your account (see Step 1)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Done! You can now work with Sigma Plus!</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Available licenses (links)</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Sigma Plus License for 3 days - for short-term use</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Sigma Plus License for 1 month (3 PC changes) - for long-term use</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Sigma Plus License for 3 months (9 PC changes) - for maximum convenience and savings</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Additional terms of use:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The license will be tied to your computer. The number of computer changes is limited (no more than once every 24 hours).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">After the license expires, you need to purchase a new license to continue using it.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">How are Sigma Plus licenses different from the usual box and dongle?</p>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" align=\"left\">\r\n<table><colgroup><col width=\"141\" /><col width=\"225\" /><col width=\"220\" /></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Capabilities</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Sigma Plus Licenses</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Sigma Plus Dongle/Box</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Supported models and functions</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">✅ Full access to the software for both solutions.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Internet connection</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Required for all operations.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Required for most operations</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Restrictions on changing the computer</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">You can change a certain number of computers - suitable for those who usually work on 1-2 computers no more than once every 24 hours</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">No restrictions - suitable for professionals who need to have portable equipment and the ability to work on any computer</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Terms of access</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Flexible terms: choose a license for 3 days, 1 month or 3 months and get instant access</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Optimal conditions for long-term use: with a dongle or box, you get access for 1 year, which you can extend for 6 months or 1 year.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Huawei authorizations</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">50 per day / 1500 per month - for small and moderate amounts of work</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">100 per day / 3000 per month - for large amounts of work</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Approximate cost per month</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Moderate, for short-term use - a flexible option for instant access, urgent use or easy start.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Low, designed for long-term use - a cost-effe