nsistently.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Delivery<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">\\u2601 Digital solution: as soon as we process your order, you can download the program and start working in a few minutes, regardless of your location.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Dongle or box - delivery worldwide, time and cost depends on the delivery service you choose.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody>\\r\\n<\\/table>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Who is the Sigma Plus license suitable for?<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Sigma Plus licenses are aimed at new users who want to get the service of all supported Sigma models without the need to have a box or dongle. This solution is suitable for both beginners and professionals due to the flexible terms of use.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">The digital license allows you to get access to the full version of Sigma Plus software in minutes, without spending time and money on product delivery.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">This is the perfect solution for those who want to start working with Sigma Plus as soon as possible!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Have additional questions? Find the answers to them in the<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/sigmakey.com\\/en\\/sigma-help\\/faq\\/\\\"> F.A.Q. section<\\/a>.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"ADDITIONAL_NVP\":\"a:2:{s:13:\\\"hide_quantity\\\";i:1;s:13:\\\"quantity_rule\\\";a:4:{s:9:\\\"min_value\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:9:\\\"max_value\\\";s:1:\\\"1\\\";s:11:\\\"multiple_of\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:9:\\\"specified\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";}}\",\"TIME\":\"1-2 Instant\",\"sync_key_data\":\"\",\"service_type_price_data\":\"\",\"qry_range_credit_info\":[{\"from_range\":1,\"to_range\":9,\"credit\":\"9.9000\"}],\"REQUIRED\":\"email\"}', '{\"CUSTOM\":null}', '2026-02-25 03:00:52', '2026-02-25 03:00:52');
INSERT INTO `remote_server_services` (`id`, `api_provider_id`, `remote_id`, `name`, `group_name`, `price`, `time`, `info`, `min_qty`, `max_qty`, `credit_groups`, `additional_fields`, `additional_data`, `params`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(1209, 2, '638', 'Sigma Plus 3 Month License ', 'Gsm Server Products', 69.0000, NULL, '<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Sigma Plus Licenses Now Available for Purchase!</h2>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Great news! You can now use Sigma Plus software without a box or dongle!</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Sigma Plus License is a fully digital version of our product that doesn\'t require a box or dongle. After instant activation, you get access to the full functionality of Sigma Plus.</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">How to buy and activate a Sigma Plus license:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">First, create an account on our website (<a href=\"https://license.sigmakey.com/auth/login\">link</a>).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Download and install the Sigma Plus software</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Log in to Sigma Plus using the email and password for your account (see Step 1)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Done! You can now work with Sigma Plus!</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Available licenses (links)</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Sigma Plus License for 3 days - for short-term use</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Sigma Plus License for 1 month (3 PC changes) - for long-term use</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Sigma Plus License for 3 months (9 PC changes) - for maximum convenience and savings</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Additional terms of use:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The license will be tied to your computer. The number of computer changes is limited (no more than once every 24 hours).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">After the license expires, you need to purchase a new license to continue using it.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">How are Sigma Plus licenses different from the usual box and dongle?</p>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" align=\"left\">\r\n<table><colgroup><col width=\"141\" /><col width=\"225\" /><col width=\"220\" /></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Capabilities</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Sigma Plus Licenses</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Sigma Plus Dongle/Box</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Supported models and functions</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">✅ Full access to the software for both solutions.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Internet connection</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Required for all operations.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Required for most operations</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Restrictions on changing the computer</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">You can change a certain number of computers - suitable for those who usually work on 1-2 computers no more than once every 24 hours</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">No restrictions - suitable for professionals who need to have portable equipment and the ability to work on any computer</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Terms of access</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Flexible terms: choose a license for 3 days, 1 month or 3 months and get instant access</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Optimal conditions for long-term use: with a dongle or box, you get access for 1 year, which you can extend for 6 months or 1 year.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Huawei authorizations</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">50 per day / 1500 per month - for small and moderate amounts of work</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">100 per day / 3000 per month - for large amounts of work</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Approximate cost per month</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Moderate, for short-term use - a flexible option for instant access, urgent use or easy start.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Low, designed for long-term use - a cost-effective choice for those who plan to work regularly and consistently.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Delivery</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">☁ Digital solution: as soon as we process your order, you can download the program and start working in a few minutes, regardless of your location.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Dongle or box - delivery worldwide, time and cost depends on the delivery service you choose.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Who is the Sigma Plus license suitable for?</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Sigma Plus licenses are aimed at new users who want to get the service of all supported Sigma models without the need to have a box or dongle. This solution is suitable for both beginners and professionals due to the flexible terms of use.</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The digital license allows you to get access to the full version of Sigma Plus software in minutes, without spending time and money on product delivery.</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">This is the perfect solution for those who want to start working with Sigma Plus as soon as possible!</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Have additional questions? Find the answers to them in the<a href=\"https://sigmakey.com/en/sigma-help/faq/\"> F.A.Q. section</a>.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '{\"SERVICEID\":638,\"SERVICENAME\":\"Sigma Plus 3 Month License \",\"CREDIT\":\"69.0000\",\"INFO\":\"<h2 dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Sigma Plus Licenses Now Available for Purchase!<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Great news! You can now use Sigma Plus software without a box or dongle!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Sigma Plus License is a fully digital version of our product that doesn\'t require a box or dongle. After instant activation, you get access to the full functionality of Sigma Plus.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">How to buy and activate a Sigma Plus license:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\">\\r\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">First, create an account on our website (<a href=