(1215, 2, '1139', ' SamsungTool.us [ 6 Months ] - [ New/Renew ]', 'Activations / Tools / Licenses', 49.0000, '1-3 Instant', '<h2>Samsung Tool [<span>&nbsp;6 Months</span>&nbsp;] - KG BYPASS</h2>\r\n<h3>Official Web:-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://samsungtool.us/\">Link !</a></h3>\r\n<h3>Tool Download Here:-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://samsungtool.us/download\">Link!</a></h3>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-5xl font-bold mb-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-800 to-gray-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent\">BIG&nbsp;<span>UPDATE COMING</span>:- Will supported bypass KG android 15</h2>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-5xl font-bold mb-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-800 to-gray-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent\">Note: OS 15 is&nbsp;<strong>not</strong>&nbsp;supported at this time !</h2>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-5xl font-bold mb-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-800 to-gray-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent\">Key Features</h2>\r\n<h4 class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Professional-grade solution with industry-leading stability and performance</h4>\r\n<div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-100 to-green-100 backdrop-blur-sm border-2 border-emerald-300 hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-500 shadow-xl card-hover-bright rounded-xl p-6\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-4\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-gray-800 font-bold text-2xl\">1. STABLE&nbsp;<span>KG LOCK BYPASS</span></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-700 text-lg leading-relaxed\">Completely hides all Knox Guard notifications and restrictions, allowing you to use the device like normal.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-100 to-cyan-100 backdrop-blur-sm border-2 border-blue-300 hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-500 shadow-xl card-hover-bright rounded-xl p-6\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-4\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-gray-800 font-bold text-2xl\">2. FACTORY RESET OK</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-700 text-lg leading-relaxed\">Perform a factory reset with peace of mind. The device will not re-lock, and you remain in full control of your data.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-yellow-100 to-orange-100 backdrop-blur-sm border-2 border-orange-300 hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-500 shadow-xl card-hover-bright rounded-xl p-6\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-4\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-gray-800 font-bold text-2xl\">3. QUICK &amp; EASY OPERATION</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-700 text-lg leading-relaxed\">Just a few clicks to complete. No deep technical knowledge required&mdash;perfect for all users.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-100 to-pink-100 backdrop-blur-sm border-2 border-purple-300 hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-500 shadow-xl card-hover-bright rounded-xl p-6\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-4\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-gray-800 font-bold text-2xl\">4. SAFE FOR YOUR DEVICE</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-700 text-lg leading-relaxed\">Software-based solution that does not interfere with your device\'s hardware or internal system components.</p>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-5xl font-bold mb-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-800 to-gray-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent\">Step-by-Step Guide</h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Follow these simple steps to successfully bypass KG Lock</p>\r\n<h3 class=\"text-orange-600 text-2xl font-bold mb-6\">PART 1:&nbsp;<span>Preparation</span></h3>\r\n<div class=\"space-y-4\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><span class=\"bg-orange-200 text-orange-700 font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">1.&nbsp;</span>Computer with Samsung USB drivers installed</div>\r\n<div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><span class=\"bg-orange-200 text-orange-700 font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">2.&nbsp;</span>High-quality USB cable for stable connection</div>\r\n<div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><span class=\"bg-orange-200 text-orange-700 font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">3.&nbsp;</span>KG Remove All OS 14 tool ready</div>\r\n<div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><span class=\"bg-orange-200 text-orange-700 font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">4.&nbsp;</span>Phone battery above 50%</div>\r\n<div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-blue-600 text-2xl font-bold mb-6\">PART 2:&nbsp;<span>Steps to Follow</span></h3>\r\n<div class=\"space-y-4\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><span class=\"bg-blue-200 text-blue-700 font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">1.&nbsp;</span>Access QR Code scanning mode from Hello screen</div>\r\n<div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><span class=\"bg-blue-200 text-blue-700 font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">2.&nbsp;</span>Scan QR code to enable ADB debugging</div>\r\n<div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><span class=\"bg-blue-200 text-blue-700 font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">3.&nbsp;</span>Run bypass tool with USB connection</div>\r\n<div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><span class=\"bg-blue-200 text-blue-700 font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">4.&nbsp;</span>Reboot and perform factory reset</div>\r\n<div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><span class=\"bg-blue-200 text-blue-700 font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">5.&nbsp;</span>Setup device normally</div>\r\n<div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-emerald-600 text-2xl font-bold mb-6\">PART 3:&nbsp;<span>Troubleshooting</span></h3>\r\n<div class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-yellow-100 to-orange-100 border border-yellow-300 rounded-xl p-6 backdrop-blur-sm\">\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-3 font-semibold\"><strong>Problem:</strong>&nbsp;Device still shows KG Lock after Factory Reset.</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-700\"><strong>Solution:</strong>&nbsp;Don\'t worry. Just repeat the process from Step 1. Re-running the procedure often fixes the issue.</p>\r\n<div class=\"text-center mb-16\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-5xl font-bold mb-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-800 to-gray-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent\">Supported Mod