ice. This can be done before you start working on the device or you can do it before every procedure. We do try to create backups...<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<div id=\\\"comp-kwe11cuz\\\" class=\\\"Z_l5lU ku3DBC zQ9jDz qvSjx3 Vq6kJx comp-kwe11cuz wixui-rich-text\\\" data-testid=\\\"richTextElement\\\">\\r\\n<h1 class=\\\"font_0 wixui-rich-text__text\\\"><span class=\\\"wixui-rich-text__text\\\"><span class=\\\"wixui-rich-text__text\\\"><span class=\\\"wixui-rich-text__text\\\"><span class=\\\"wixui-rich-text__text\\\">And of course, there is a lot more E-GSM TOOL can do!<br class=\\\"wixui-rich-text__text\\\" \\/>Click any specific function to see its supported models list.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/h1>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<section id=\\\"comp-kwfdjw3e\\\" class=\\\"comp-kwfdjw3e CohWsy wixui-column-strip\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"V5AUxf\\\" data-testid=\\\"columns\\\">\\r\\n<div id=\\\"comp-kwfdjw5u\\\" class=\\\"comp-kwfdjw5u YzqVVZ wixui-column-strip__column\\\">\\r\\n<div data-mesh-id=\\\"comp-kwfdjw5uinlineContent\\\" data-testid=\\\"inline-content\\\">\\r\\n<div data-mesh-id=\\\"comp-kwfdjw5uinlineContent-gridContainer\\\" data-testid=\\\"mesh-container-content\\\">\\r\\n<div id=\\\"comp-kwfdkane\\\" class=\\\"Z_l5lU ku3DBC zQ9jDz qvSjx3 Vq6kJx comp-kwfdkane wixui-rich-text\\\" data-testid=\\\"richTextElement\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\\\"><span class=\\\"wixui-rich-text__text\\\"><span class=\\\"wixui-rich-text__text\\\"><span class=\\\"wixui-rich-text__text\\\">\\u25cf&nbsp; &nbsp;Read Information<\\/span><br class=\\\"wixui-rich-text__text\\\" \\/><span class=\\\"wixui-rich-text__text\\\">\\u25cf&nbsp; &nbsp;Remove FRP<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\\\"><span class=\\\"wixui-rich-text__text\\\"><span class=\\\"wixui-rich-text__text\\\"><span class=\\\"wixui-rich-text__text\\\">\\u25cf&nbsp; &nbsp;Backup Nvdata<br class=\\\"wixui-rich-text__text\\\" \\/>\\u25cf&