(1343, 2, '15', 'Nck Dongle / Nck Box Activation [ Yearly ]', 'Activations / Tools / Licenses', 23.0000, '0-1 Instant', '<p>Card active!. 1 Year activation active Use NCK Dongle v18.8 or above version When Activation msg display, UPDATE Card/Dongle Restart Software Now you can use all new modules.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Note: Please update card first using NCK Dongle Main Module v18.8 if card is updated security OK&nbsp; then submit NCK activation, If Card not update security then DO NOT SUBMIT</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><strong>NCK Dongle / NCK Box 1 Year Activation&nbsp;</strong>is meant for users who bought NCK Dongle / NCK Box more than 1 year ago. Allows you to prolong access to the future NCK software versions for 1 more year.</p>\r\n<p>Please provide us with your NCK Box / Dongle serial number (must be 9 characters long) while placing an order.</p>\r\n<p><strong>*Important!</strong>&nbsp;If you need to prolong the support for both NCK and UMT features on these devices, please buy&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>NCK (Dongle/Box) 1 Year Activation and UMT (<strong>Dongle/Box) 1 Year Activation.</strong></strong></p>\r\n<p>If you need to prolong support only for one solution: NCK or UMT &ndash; just purchase the corresponding activation, other one is not required.</p>\r\n<h2 id=\"find-serial-number\" data-id=\"3-where-to-find-the-serial-number\">Where to find the serial number?</h2>\r\n<p>You can find your serial number using the NCK Main Module software.</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Download the latest version of NCK Main Module software:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><a title=\"Software\" href=\"http://nckbox.com/downloads/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>NCK Box Software</strong></a></li>\r\n<li><a title=\"Software\" href=\"https://nckdongle.com/downloads/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>NCK Dongle Software</strong></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>Run the Main Module software to read the serial number of your box/dongle.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div class=\"full-img\"><img src=\"https://f00.psgsm.net/product/849423/nck-serial-number.jpg\" alt=\"Find your serial number at the botom\" /></div>\r\n<p><strong>Note!</strong>&nbsp;Use NCK Box software for a box and NCK Dongle software for a dongle, not vice versa.</p>\r\n<h2 data-id=\"0-nck-dongle-nck-box-act-activation-features\">NCK Dongle / NCK Box - ACT1 Activation Features</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>MicroMax unlimited calculations &ndash; Server Based</li>\r\n<li>Alcatel Android Unlimited calculations &ndash; Server Based</li>\r\n<li>HTC Android Decoding</li>\r\n<li>Read Huawei Gxxx series codes via cable, unlimited decoding &ndash; Server Based</li>\r\n<li>Avivo unlimited calculations &ndash; Server Based</li>\r\n<li>VeryKool unlimited calculations &ndash; Server Based</li>\r\n<li>Huawei Qcomm modems</li>\r\n<li>MessagePhone unlimited calculations &ndash; Server Based</li>\r\n<li>Gtran unlimited calculations &ndash; Server Based</li>\r\n<li>Spice unlimited calculations &ndash; Server Based</li>\r\n<li>Chibo Mobiles calculations</li>\r\n<li>and more...</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-id=\"1-nck-dongle-nck-box-cdma-features\">NCK Dongle / NCK Box - CDMA Features</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Samsung CDMA</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Flash, Decode, Repair</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>ZTE CDMA</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Flash, Decode, Repair</li>\r\n<li>Auto model detection, auto flash chip detection to prevent wrong flashing (exclusive feature)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-id=\"2-nck-dongle-nck-box-iden-palm-activation-features\">NCK Dongle / NCK Box - Iden/Palm Activation Features</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Motorola Iden</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Decode CNS Old</li>\r\n<li>Decode CNS New</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Palm Pixi/Pre</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Auto detect phone model</li>\r\n<li>Decoding method</li>\r\n<li>Decodes phones with blocked counter</li>\r\n<li>No flashing phone or installing Java Apps</li>\r\n<li>4-Step decoding method</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>If you still have a valid access, you won`t be able to add this activation.<br />Wait until your access period is over and then buy this activation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>#shandy</p>\r\n<p><strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong></strong></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '{\"SERVICEID\":15,\"SERVICENAME\":\"Nck Dongle \\/ Nck Box Activation [ Yearly ]\",\"CREDIT\":\"23.0000\",\"INFO\":\"<p>Card active!. 1 Year activation active Use NCK Dongle v18.8 or above version When Activation msg display, UPDATE Card\\/Dongle Restart Software Now you can use all new modules.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #ff0000;\\\"><strong>Note: Please update card first using NCK Dongle Main Module v18.8 if card is updated security OK&nbsp; then submit NCK activation, If Card not update security then DO NOT SUBMIT<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>NCK Dongle \\/ NCK Box 1 Year Activation&nbsp;<\\/strong>is meant for users who bought NCK Dongle \\/ NCK Box more than 1 year ago. Allows you to prolong access to the future NCK software versions for 1 more year.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Please provide us with your NCK Box \\/ Dongle serial number (must be 9 characters long) while placing an order.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>*Important!<\\/strong>&nbsp;If you need to prolong the support for both NCK and UMT features on these devices, please buy&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>NCK (Dongle\\/Box) 1 Year Activation and UMT (<strong>Dongle\\/Box) 1 Year Activation.<\\/strong><\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>If you need to prolong support only for one solution: NCK or UMT &ndash; just purchase the corresponding activation, other one is not required.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 id=\\\"find-serial-number\\\" data-id=\\\"3-where-to-find-the-serial-number\\\">Where to find the serial number?<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>You can find your serial number using the NCK Main Module software.<\\/p>\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n<li>Download the latest version of NCK Main Module software:\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li><a title=\\\"Software\\\" href=\\\"http:\\/