(1348, 2, '729', 'Nooox Tool [ 1 Year ] [ 1 PC ]', 'Activations / Tools / Licenses', 21.8900, '1-3 Minutes', '<p>Nooox is a professional software tool designed to repair Xiaomi, LG, Honor, Huawei, Tecno, Motorola, Infinix, Vivo phones based on Qualcomm, Unisoc (Spreadtrum), and Mediatek processors.</p>\r\n<div class=\"notification info\">\r\n<p><strong>This license is valid for 1 year.</strong></p>\r\n<h2>Features</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Auth | Authentication</li>\r\n<li>Repair IMEI</li>\r\n<li>Patch Certificate</li>\r\n<li>Fix corrupted NVData</li>\r\n<li>Unlock Bootloader</li>\r\n<li>Read Information</li>\r\n<li>Remove FRP</li>\r\n<li>Wipe NVRAM</li>\r\n<li>Correct NVRAM Errors (for some models)</li>\r\n<li>Activate 2 SIM Cards</li>\r\n<li>Repair RSA Phone Repair</li>\r\n<li>Remove/Bypass Mi Account</li>\r\n<li>Flash Firmware</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"notification warning\">\r\n<h2 id=\"7-how-to-buy\">How to Buy</h2>\r\n<ol><ol>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://www.noooxtool.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Download software</a></li>\r\n<li>Register your account using this software:</li>\r\n</ol></ol>\r\n<div class=\"full-img\"><img src=\"https://f00.psgsm.net/product/913733/1-press-register.png\" alt=\"Press Register Account\" width=\"600\" /></div>\r\n<p>Press Register Account</p>\r\n<div class=\"full-img\"><img src=\"https://f00.psgsm.net/product/913733/2-enter-userdata.png\" alt=\"Press Register Account\" width=\"600\" /></div>\r\n<p>Enter your data. Press Register</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;3) While placing your order, indicate the email you used to register</p>\r\n<p><strong>*Latest security patches are not supported on LG phones, you will have to downgrade the firmware version*</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"notification info\">\r\n<p>TECNO, Infinix, ZTE, Wiko, Itel, Gigaset, Multilaser, Zoji, Meizu, Blu, lephone, Gionee, UIefone, Hisense, Lava / Doogee, Blackview, Prestigio, Alcatel, Lenovo, and Vivo devices are not listed as supported. Even though, Reset FRP, Unlock Bootloader and Repair IMEI operations are supported on these devices, as the testing process is not finished.</p>\r\n<p>Reset FRP, Unlock Bootloader and Device Authorization operations are supported on Oppo / Realme devices.</p>\r\n<div class=\"notification info\">\r\n<p><strong>Repair IMEI is supported for some devices via Diag! Other brands and models are not listed but may be supported.</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>*The developer provides support only for those phones which are on the list of supported. Not all servicing features can be applied to some supported models, due to differences of hardware/software versions. You can find a complete list of supported models on the official product page.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>#shandy</p>\r\n<p><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\" /><br /></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"yt-video -inside-dom\" data-video-id=\"w2YARGrWwEo\" data-width=\"560\" data-height=\"315\">\r\n<div class=\"yt-video_container\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '{\"SERVICEID\":729,\"SERVICENAME\":\"Nooox Tool [ 1 Year ] [ 1 PC ]\",\"CREDIT\":\"21.8900\",\"INFO\":\"<p>Nooox is a professional software tool designed to repair Xiaomi, LG, Honor, Huawei, Tecno, Motorola, Infinix, Vivo phones based on Qualcomm, Unisoc (Spreadtrum), and Mediatek processors.<\\/p>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"notification info\\\">\\r\\n<p><strong>This license is valid for 1 year.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>Features<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Auth | Authentication<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Repair IMEI<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Patch Certificate<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Fix corrupted NVData<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Unlock Bootloader<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Read Information<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Remove FRP<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Wipe NVRAM<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Correct NVRAM Errors (for some models)<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Activate 2 SIM Cards<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Repair RSA Phone Repair<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Remove\\/Bypass Mi Account<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Flash Firmware<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\