(1385, 2, '589', 'TFM Tool Pro [ 3 Months Activation ]', 'Activations / Tools / Licenses', 20.0000, '0-1 Instant', '<h2 data-id=\"0-how-to-buy-tfm-tool-pro-activation\">How to buy TFM Tool Pro Activation:</h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://www.tfmtool.com/register\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Register at tfmtool.com</a></li>\r\n<li>Indicate the email you used for registration while placing your order.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://tfmtool.com/downloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Download TFM Tool Pro</a></p>\r\n<p>TFM Pro is a multibrand tool for servicing Samsung, Xiaomi, Vivo, Tecno, Infinix and many other smartphones based on MTK, Qualcomm, and Unisoc (Spreadtrum) chipsets.</p>\r\n<h2 data-id=\"0-latest-updates\">Latest updates</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lots of MTK models with 2024 Security are supported</li>\r\n<li>Remove MDM (permanently) for Tecno, Infinix, Itel phones.</li>\r\n<li>Lots of Unisoc 2023-2024 patches/builds supported</li>\r\n<li>Added Unisoc exploits that will considerably extend supported models list</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-id=\"1-what-you-get\">What you get:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Access for 3 months to all modules</li>\r\n<li>Free regular updates and support</li>\r\n<li>Using modules simultaneously while working on the same PC</li>\r\n<li>All your work history is saved.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>( You can change PCs every 6 hours. )</strong></p>\r\n<h2 data-id=\"3-main-module-features\">Main Module - Features:</h2>\r\n<h3 data-id=\"4-samsung-remove-frp\">Samsung - Remove FRP</h3>\r\n<p>Don\'t need to use Test Point, Enable ADB, or #0#. Works on ALL Android versions and ALL Security Patches.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Samsung Exynos:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Reset EFS / Restore Original IMEI / Repair Unknown Baseband (up to Android 9 / most of 2017 devices are supported).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Old Samsung:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Reset FRP in Download Mode</li>\r\n<li>Factory Reset</li>\r\n<li>Reset MDM</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>All Samsung:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Factory Reset Screen</li>\r\n<li>Reboot to Recovery/Download Mode</li>\r\n<li>Reset FRP in ADB mode</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Oppo:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Remove Sim Lock (up to Android 9, Oppo A5s, etc.)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>ADB and Fastboot</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Reset FRP</li>\r\n<li>Remove screen lock without data loss (old china SPD phones, etc.)</li>\r\n<li>Factory reset in run mode</li>\r\n<li>Multiple apk installation</li>\r\n<li>Reboot to Recovery</li>\r\n<li>Reboot to Fastboot</li>\r\n<li>Reboot from Fastboot</li>\r\n<li>FRP Reset in Fastboot Mode (old SPD devices)</li>\r\n<li>Reboot to recovery special: SPD(6820/8810,6825/8825)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-id=\"5-supported-cpus\">Supported CPUs</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>MT0571 MT0598 MT0992 MT2601 MT3967 MT6255 MT6261 MT6280 MT6735 MT6735 MT6737M MT6739 MT6739 MT6750 MT6752 MT6755 MT6757 MT6758 MT6759 MT6761 MT6763 MT6765 MT6768 MT6771 MT6779 MT6781 MT6785 MT6789 (Helio G99) MT6795 MT6797 MT6799 MT6833 MT6853 MT6873 MT6877 MT6885 MT6893 MT6983 (Dimensity 9000) MT8110 MT8127 MT8135 MT8163 MT8167 MT8168 MT8173 MT8176 MT8512 MT8518 MT8590 MT8695 MT8696</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-id=\"6-mtk-module-features\">MTK Module - Features</h2>\r\n<p><strong>World`s first!</strong>&nbsp;Vivo Auth - the most wanted Vivo exclusive models are now supported totally free (2023 Security).</p>\r\n<p><strong>World`s first!</strong>&nbsp;many Secured/Non-secured models are supported.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Read / Write Firmware, NVRAM, NV Data, Screen Lock, Preloader.</li>\r\n<li>Meta Operations: Read Info, Factory Reset, Demo Decoding, Read / Write NVRAM/NV Data</li>\r\n<li>Boot Mode: Reset FRP, Factory Reset, Reset Privacy Lock, Read / Write Flash, Boot Info</li>\r\n<li>OFP (Oppo Oficial Firmware) Extractor</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-id=\"7-qcom-module-features\">Qcom Module - Features:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>EDL Mode: Read / Write Firmware, Reset EFS, Reset FRP, Backup EFS, Restore EFS, Factory Reset, Reset MI Account, Device Info, Mi offline operations, Samsung Qcom MDM Reset, Flash, Reset FRP (TP/EDL)</li>\r\n<li>Diag: Backup and Restore QCN</li>\r\n<li>Reboot to EDL, MI Factory Reset (Assistant Mode/Sideload), Read Info Assistant/Sidelaod Mode, MI Relock Fix (up to Android 8)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Note:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>for Auth Security phones, use the Disable Auth feature in the Settings.</li>\r\n<li>for models not in the list, load Scatter files.</li>\r\n<li>for not supported Secure Boot phones (auth devices), select the Auth Bypass feature in the Settings.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-id=\"61-how-to-use-exploits\">How to use exploits</h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>For brands: select \"0_ UNISOC Tiger\", \"0_ SC773X\" or a desired chipset series, etc.</li>\r\n<li>For models: select the correct CPU/Chipset like Tiger T612_64/SC7731E or any SoC listed above.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h2 data-id=\"62-package-content\">Package Content</h2>\r\n<p><strong>The product is digital - no packaging!</strong></p>\r\n<p>DO NOT EXPECT ANY CARD SHIPPED to you. The plastic card on the picture is only for design purposes.</p>\r\n<p>*The developer provides support only for those phones which are on the list of supported. Not all servicing features can be applied to some supported models, due to differences of hardware/software versions. You can find a complete list of supported models on the official product page.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>#shandy</p>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '{\"SERVICEID\":589,\"SERVICENAME\":\"TFM Tool Pro [ 3 Months Activation ]\",\"CREDIT\":\"20.0000\",\"INFO\":\"<h2 data-id=\\\"0-how-to-buy-tfm-tool-pro-activation\\\">How to buy TFM Tool Pro Activation:<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n<li><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.tfmtool.com\\/register\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">Register at tfmtool.com<\\/a><\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Indicate the e