(1397, 2, '168', 'UMT 1 Year Activation', 'Activations / Tools / Licenses', 23.0000, '0-1 Instant', '<h1>Ultimate Multi Tool 1 Year Activation</h1>\r\n<div class=\"category-info\">\r\n<p>This is Normal 1 year activation to use all modules but not related to HUAWEI Module.</p>\r\n<p>For Huawei module you must purchase it on its own and it is unlimited = no yearly activation needed</p>\r\n<p><strong>UMT 1 Year Activation&nbsp;</strong>is meant for users who bought UMT Dongle / UMT Box more than 1 year ago. Allows you to prolong access to the future UMT software versions for 1 more year.</p>\r\n<p>Please provide us with your UMT Box / Dongle serial number while placing an order.</p>\r\n<h2 id=\"find-serial-number\">Where to find the serial number?</h2>\r\n<p>You can find your serial number using the UMT Card Manager software.</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Download the latest version of&nbsp;<a href=\"https://mega.nz/file/51NxxIyL#h97wHWq6kClyKz2CEKK2xPvWWkwCiZAKrxyhdMBhC-k\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">UMT Card Manager software</a></li>\r\n<li>Run this software to read the serial number of your box/dongle.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div class=\"full-img\"><img src=\"https://f00.psgsm.net/product/886684/umt-serial-number.jpg\" alt=\"Find your serial number at the botom\" /></div>\r\n<p>UMT serial number looks like this: UMTXXXXXXXXX</p>\r\n<p>If you still have a valid access, you won`t be able to add this activation.<br />Wait until your access period is over and then buy this activation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '{\"SERVICEID\":168,\"SERVICENAME\":\"UMT 1 Year Activation\",\"CREDIT\":\"23.0000\",\"INFO\":\"<h1>Ultimate Multi Tool 1 Year Activation<\\/h1>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"category-info\\\">\\r\\n<p>This is Normal 1 year activation to use all modules but not related to HUAWEI Module.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>For Huawei module you must purchase it on its own and it is unlimited = no yearly activation needed<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>UMT 1 Year Activation&nbsp;<\\/strong>is meant for users who bought UMT Dongle \\/ UMT Box more than 1 year ago. Allows you to prolong access to the future UMT software versions for 1 more year.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Please provide us with your UMT Box \\/ Dongle serial number while placing an order.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 id=\\\"find-serial-number\\\">Where to find the serial number?<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>You can find your serial number using the UMT Card Manager software.<\\/p>\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n<li>Download the latest version of&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/mega.nz\\/file\\/51NxxIyL#h97wHWq6kClyKz2CEKK2xPvWWkwCiZAKrxyhdMBhC-k\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">UMT Card Manager software<\\/a><\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Run this software to read the serial number of your box\\/dongle.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"full-img\\\"><img src=\\\"https:\\/\\/f00.psgsm.net\\/product\\/886684\\/umt-serial-number.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Find your serial number at the botom\\\" \\/><\\/div>\\r\\n<p>UMT serial number looks like this: UMTXXXXXXXXX<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>If you still have a valid access, you won`t be able to add this activation.<br \\/>Wait until your access period is over and then buy this activation.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\",\"ADDITIONAL_NVP\":\"a:2:{s:13:\\\"hide_quantity\\\";i:1;s:13:\\\"quantity_rule\\\";a:4:{s:9:\\\"min_value\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:9:\\\"max_value\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:11:\\\"multiple_of\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:9:\\\"specified\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";}}\",\"TIME\":\"0-1 Instant\",\"sync_key_data\":\"\",\"service_type_price_data\":\"\",\"qry_range_credit_info\":[{\"from_range\":1,\"to_range\":9,\"credit\":\"23.0000\"}],\"REQUIRED\":\"SERIAL_NUMBER\"}', '{\"CUSTOM\":null}', '2026-02-25 03:00:52', '2026-02-25 03:00:52'),
(1398, 2, '604', 'UMT Activation For NCK BOX / DONGLE & AVB Cards', 'Activations / Tools / Licenses', 30.0000, '0-1 Instant', '<p><strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Before Buying Activation - IMPORTANT!!!&nbsp;<br /><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Download Software here</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p>https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1NY4sqbwjRKLHKItgOz9jL9ahs0hux7lA&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Pass for Updater Software is: UmtTeam</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Run Software and Press Check Card, it will then tell you that your card can be updated or not, before buying the activation, once you checked you buy the Activation at your own risk if log shows that you cannot update card.</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><br /><br />How to update NCK or Avengers box Card using this UMT Activation Method.</span> </strong></p>\r\n<p>1. Download UMT Activation FOR NCK &amp; AVB - software from link provided.</p>\r\n<p>2. extract to folder.</p>\r\n<p>3. Download Update file and put this file in same folder as UMT Activation Software folder, (must be unzipped if you receive as zip file).</p>\r\n<p>4. Start UMT Activation FOR NCK &amp; AVB software.</p>\r\n<p>5. Click Get Card Info then Click update card. 5.1. Choose downloaded file. 5.2. Wait until card finish updating.</p>\r\n<p>6. Exit software.</p>\r\n<p>7. <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1NY4sqbwjRKLHKItgOz9jL9ahs0hux7lA\">Download</a>&nbsp; and start UMT Card updater Software &amp; Update card using this software.</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000; background-color: #ffffff;\">Rar Password:&nbsp;NckTeam&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>8. All done, now you can start using UMT Modules.<br /><br /><strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Card: jocp10v231 = jcop 10 then this card does not have enough ram</span></strong><br /><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #008000;\"><strong>if card: JCOP21 then we can proceed with activation.</strong></span></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '{\"SERVICEID\":604,\"SERVICENAME\":\"UMT Activation For NCK BOX \\/ DONGLE & AVB Cards\",\"CREDIT\":\"30.0000\",\"INFO\":\"<p><strong><span style=\\\"color: #ff0000;\\\">Before Buying Activation - IMPORTANT!!!&nbsp;<br \\/><span style=\\\"color: #000000;\\\">Download Software here<\\/span><\\/span><\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>https:\\/\\/drive.google.com\\/drive\\/folders\\/1NY4sqbwjRKLHKItgOz9jL9ahs0hux7lA&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Pass for Updater Software is: UmtTeam<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Run Software and Press Check Card, it will then tell you that your card can be updated or not, before buying the activation, once you checked you buy the Activation at your own risk if log shows that you cannot update card.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong><span style=\\\"color: #ff0000;\\\"><br \\/><br \\/>How to update NCK or Avengers box Card using this UMT Activation Method.<\\/span> <\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>1. Download UMT Activation FOR NCK &amp; AVB - software from link provided.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>2. extract to folder.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>3. Download Update file and put this file in same folder as UMT Activation Software folder, (must be unzipped if you receive as zip file).<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>4. Start UMT Activation FOR NCK &amp; AVB software.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>5. Click Get Card Info then Click update card. 5.1. Choose downloaded file. 5.2. Wait until card finish updating.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>6. Exit software.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>7. <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/drive.google.com\\/drive\\/folders\\/1NY4sqbwjRKLHKItgOz9jL9ahs0hux7lA\\\">Download<\\/a>&nbsp; and start UMT Card updater Software &amp; Update card using this software.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong><span style=\\\"color: #ff0000; background-color: #ffffff;\\\">Rar Password:&nbsp;NckTeam&nbsp;<\\/span><\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>8. All done, now you can start using UMT Modules.<br \\/><br \\/><strong><span style=\\\"color: #ff0000;\\\">Card: jocp10v231 = jcop 10 then this card does not have enough ram<\\/span><\\/strong><br \\/><span style=\\\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #008000;\\\"><strong>if card: JCOP21 then we can proceed with activation.<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p>\",\"ADDITIONAL_NVP\":\"a:2:{s:13:\\\"hide_quantity\\\";i:1;s:13:\\\"quantity_rule\\\";a:4:{s:9:\\\"min_value\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:9:\\\"max_value\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:11:\\\"multiple_of\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:9:\\\"specified\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";}}\",\"TIME\":\"0-1 Instant\",\"sync_key_data\":\"\",\"service_type_price_data\":\"\",\"qry_range_credit_info\":[{\"from_range\":1,\"to_range\":99,\"credit\":\"30.0000\"}],\"REQUIRED\":\"Serial No:\"}', '{\"CUSTOM\":null}', '2026-02-25 03:00:52', '2026-02-25 03:00:52'),
