__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">●&nbsp; &nbsp;Enable Diag root</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">●&nbsp; &nbsp;Flash TWRP [Fastboot]</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">●&nbsp; &nbsp;Reboot Fastboot</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">●&nbsp; &nbsp;Read Info [ADB]</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">●&nbsp; &nbsp;Reboot [ADB]</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">●&nbsp; &nbsp;Reboot Recovery</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">●&nbsp; &nbsp;Fastboot To Edl</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">●&nbsp; &nbsp;Fastboot Exit</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">●&nbsp; &nbsp;Recovery To Normal</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">●&nbsp; &nbsp;Backup EFS [TWRP]</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">●&nbsp; &nbsp;Restore EFS [TWRP]</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">●&nbsp; &nbsp;Reset Mi Account</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">●&nbsp; &nbsp;Wipe EFS [TWRP]&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">●&nbsp; &nbsp;E-GSM ROOT [TWRP ]</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">●&nbsp; &nbsp;Repair IMEI</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">●&nbsp; &nbsp;Backup QCN</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">●&nbsp; &nbsp;Restore QCN</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">●&nbsp; &nbsp;Load QCN</span></span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"comp-kwfdk0v0\" class=\"comp-kwfdk0v0 YzqVVZ wixui-column-strip__column\">\r\n<div id=\"bgLayers_comp-kwfdk0v0\" class=\"MW5IWV\" data-hook=\"bgLayers\" data-motion-part=\"BG_LAYER comp-kwfdk0v0\">&nbsp;</di