(1509, 2, '517', 'TFM Tool Pro Credit Recharge [Instant] ', 'Official Server Credits', 0.9200, '1-2 Instant', '<h1>&nbsp;TFM Tool Pro Credit Recharge [Instant]</h1>\r\n<h1>&nbsp;</h1>\r\n<h2 id=\"how-to-buy\" data-id=\"0-how-to-buy-tfm-tool-pro-activation\">How to buy TFM Tool Pro Activation:</h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://www.tfmtool.com/register\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Register at tfmtool.com</a></li>\r\n<li>Indicate the username you used for registration while placing your order.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://tfmtool.com/downloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Download TFM Tool Pro</a></p>\r\n<h2 data-id=\"1-what-you-get\">What you get:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Access for 2 years to all modules</li>\r\n<li>Free regular updates and support</li>\r\n<li>Using modules simultaneously while working on the same PC</li>\r\n<li>All your work history is saved.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>( You can change PCs every 6 hours. )</strong></p>\r\n<h2 data-id=\"3-exclusive-features\">Exclusive Features:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>World`s first!</strong>&nbsp;Remove MDM in one click for Unisoc-based Tecno / Infinix / Itel models.</li>\r\n<li><strong>World`s first!</strong>&nbsp;Vivo Auth for the most wanted Vivo exclusive models for free (2023 Security).</li>\r\n<li><strong>World`s first</strong>&nbsp;Remove Demo for VIVO MTK-based models (Android 11*)</li>\r\n<li><strong>World`s first</strong>&nbsp;Reset EFS for many VIVO Qcom-based models.</li>\r\n<li><strong>World`s first</strong>&nbsp;Remove Huawei ID without damaging security for the latest MTK-based models</li>\r\n<li><strong>World`s first</strong>&nbsp;Fix the \"Tool DL Image Failed\" error on the latest Android phones (up to Android 11)</li>\r\n<li>Read / Write / Erase any single partition easily with Partition Manager (MTK)</li>\r\n<li>Remove Demo(Diag) for all VIVO Qcom/MTK-based phones (Android 10)</li>\r\n<li>Factory Reset for all VIVO Qcom/MTK-based models</li>\r\n<li>Factory Reset / Remove Demo (Meta/Boot Mode) for all MTK-based Oppo/Realme models</li>\r\n<li>Flash / Reset Boot Mode (without auth) for Xiaomi/Poco/Oppo/VIVO/Realme models<br /><br />*<strong>Oppo F19 Pro, A31, A15, A15s, A12, A1K</strong>&nbsp;and other MTK models - Factory Reset / Reset FRP / Read / Write Flash etc. supported</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-id=\"4-main-module-features\">Main Module - Features:</h2>\r\n<h3 data-id=\"5-samsung-remove-frp\">Samsung - Remove FRP</h3>\r\n<p>Don\'t need to use Test Point, Enable ADB, or #0#. Works on ALL Android versions and ALL Security Patches.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Samsung Exynos:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Reset EFS / Restore Original IMEI / Repair Unknown Baseband (up to Android 9 / most of 2017 devices are supported).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Old Samsung:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Reset FRP in Download Mode</li>\r\n<li>Factory Reset</li>\r\n<li>Reset MDM</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>All Samsung:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Factory Reset Screen</li>\r\n<li>Reboot to Recovery/Download Mode</li>\r\n<li>Reset FRP in ADB mode</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>OPPO:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Remove Sim Lock (up to Android 9, Oppo A5s, etc.)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>ADB and Fastboot</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Reset FRP</li>\r\n<li>Remove screen lock without data loss (old china SPD phones, etc.)</li>\r\n<li>Factory reset in run mode</li>\r\n<li>Multiple apk installation</li>\r\n<li>Reboot to Recovery</li>\r\n<li>Reboot to Fastboot</li>\r\n<li>Reboot from Fastboot</li>\r\n<li>FRP Reset in Fastboot Mode (old SPD devices)</li>\r\n<li>Reboot to recovery special: SPD(6820/8810,6825/8825)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-id=\"6-mtk-module-features\">MTK Module - Features:</h2>\r\n<p><strong>World`s first</strong>&nbsp;many Secured/Non-secured models are supported.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Read / Write Firmware, NVRAM, NV Data, Screen Lock, Preloader.</li>\r\n<li>Meta Operations: Read Info, Factory Reset, Demo Decoding, Read / Write NVRAM/NV Data</li>\r\n<li>Boot Mode: Reset FRP