(1602, 2, '758', '1) V-Ray EDU Account + Pass [ 1 Year ] [ All Premium Features ] ', '3D Rendering Engines / Visualization Tools', 132.4000, '12 - 24 Hours', '<p>V-Ray EDU Account + Pass [1 Year] [All Premium Features]</p>\r\n<p>Service Description:</p>\r\n<p>Get full access to V-Ray EDU&nbsp; for 1 year &mdash; perfect for those looking for professional-quality rendering tools at a fraction of the cost.</p>\r\n<p>⸻</p>\r\n<p>Includes:<br /> &bull; Valid V-Ray EDU Account (Student/Faculty License)<br /> &bull; 1-Year Access to:<br /> &bull; V-Ray for SketchUp, 3ds Max, Rhino, Revit, Cinema 4D, etc.<br /> &bull; Chaos Cosmos 3D asset library<br /> &bull; V-Ray GPU and CPU rendering<br /> &bull; Integration with Chaos Cloud, Chaos Scans, and Chaos Phoenix<br /> &bull; All Premium Features included &mdash; same as the commercial version<br /> &bull; Fully legal and licensed under Chaos Group&rsquo;s Educational Terms</p>\r\n<p>⸻</p>\r\n<p>Delivery Time:<br /> &bull; Account details and activation within 12&ndash;24 hours</p>\r\n<p>What You&rsquo;ll Receive:<br /> &bull; EDU-verified V-Ray Account (email/password or license key)<br /> &bull; Activation instructions<br /> &bull; Full access to V-Ray software and Chaos ecosystem</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;Official Website:</p>\r\n<p>https://www.chaos.com/vray</p>\r\n<p>This is the main V-Ray page where you can:<br /> &bull; Explore versions for SketchUp, 3ds Max, Rhino, Revit, Cinema 4D, Maya, and more<br /> &bull; View features, pricing, and educational plans<br /> &bull; Start a free trial</p>\r\n<p>Download / Free Trial Page:</p>\r\n<p>https://www.chaos.com/vray/trial</p>\r\n<p>From here you can:<br /> &bull; Select your platform (e.g., SketchUp, 3ds Max, etc.)<br /> &bull; Sign in or create a Chaos account<br /> &bull; Download the installer</p>\r\n<p>Download Steps:<br /> 1. Go to the download page above<br /> 2. Choose your V-Ray version (e.g., V-Ray for SketchUp)<br /> 3. Log in or sign up with a Chaos account<br /> 4. Download the installer for your OS (Windows/macOS)<br /> 5. Follow the installer instructions</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>#shandy</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '{\"SERVICEID\":758,\"SERVICENAME\":\"1) V-Ray EDU Account + Pass [ 1 Year ] [ All Premium Features ] \",\"CREDIT\":\"132.4000\",\"INFO\":\"<p>V-Ray EDU Account + Pass [1 Year] [All Premium Features]<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Service Description:<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Get full access to V-Ray EDU&nbsp; for 1 year &mdash; perfect for those looking for professional-quality rendering tools at a fraction of the cost.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u2e3b<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Includes:<br \\/> &bull; Valid V-Ray EDU Account (Student\\/Faculty License)<br \\/> &bull; 1-Year Access to:<br \\/> &bull; V-Ray for SketchUp, 3ds Max, Rhino, Revit, Cinema 4D, etc.<br \\/> &bull; Chaos Cosmos 3D asset library<br \\/> &bull; V-Ray GPU and CPU rendering<br \\/> &bull; Integration with Chaos Cloud, Chaos Scans, and Chaos Phoenix<br \\/> &bull; All Premium Features included &mdash; same as the commercial version<br \\/> &bull; Fully legal and licensed under Chaos Group&rsquo;s Educational Terms<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u2e3b<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Delivery Time:<br \\/> &bull; Account details and activation within 12&ndash;24 hours<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>What You&rsquo;ll Receive:<br \\/> &bull; EDU-verified V-Ray Account (email\\/password or license key)<br \\/> &bull; Activation instructions<br \\/> &bull; Full access to V-Ray software and Chaos ecosystem<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;Official Website:<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>https:\\/\\/www.chaos.com\\/vray<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>This is the main V-Ray page where you can:<br \\/> &bull; Explore versions for SketchUp, 3ds Max, Rhino, Revit, Cinema 4D, Maya, and more<br \\/> &bull; View features, pricing, and educational plans<br \\/> &bull; Start a free trial<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Download \\/ Free Trial Page:<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>https:\\/\\/www.chaos.com\\/vray\\/trial<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>From here you can:<br \\/> &bull; Select your platform (e.g., SketchUp, 3ds Max, etc.)<br \\/