wnload<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>From this page, you can:<br \\/> &bull; Choose your platform (3ds Max or Cinema 4D)<br \\/> &bull; Sign in with your Chaos account<br \\/> &bull; Download the installer for Windows<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>#shandy<\\/p>\",\"ADDITIONAL_NVP\":\"a:2:{s:13:\\\"hide_quantity\\\";i:1;s:13:\\\"quantity_rule\\\";a:4:{s:9:\\\"min_value\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:9:\\\"max_value\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:11:\\\"multiple_of\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:9:\\\"specified\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";}}\",\"TIME\":\"12 - 24 Hours\",\"sync_key_data\":\"\",\"service_type_price_data\":\"\",\"qry_range_credit_info\":[{\"from_range\":1,\"to_range\":100,\"credit\":\"202.9000\"}],\"REQUIRED\":\"\"}', '{\"CUSTOM\":null}', '2026-02-25 03:00:52', '2026-02-25 03:00:52'),
(1604, 2, '760', '3) SketchUp EDU for Web - Account + Pass [ 1 Year ]', '3D Rendering Engines / Visualization Tools', 16.4000, '12 - 24  Hours', '<p>SketchUp EDU for Web &ndash; Account + Pass [1 Year]</p>\r\n<p>Service Description:<br />Get 1-year access to SketchUp for Schools or SketchUp EDU Web version &mdash; a browser-based 3D modeling tool designed specifically for students, teachers, and academic institutions. No installation required.</p>\r\n<p>Included Features:<br /> &bull; SketchUp EDU web-based account (Google or Microsoft login)<br /> &bull; 1-year valid educational license<br /> &bull; Full access to SketchUp&rsquo;s core modeling tools in your web browser<br /> &bull; Seamless integration with Google Drive or Microsoft OneDrive<br /> &bull; Supports K&ndash;12 and higher education institutions<br /> &bull; Access to 3D Warehouse and other online assets<br /> &bull; Collaborative features for classroom or group projects</p>\r\n<p>Delivery Time:<br /> &bull; Login credentials and activation instructions delivered within 12 to 24 hours</p>\r\n<p>What You Will Receive:<br /> &bull; Verified SketchUp EDU web account (Google or Microsoft-based)<br /> &bull; 1-year pass/license<br /> &bull; Setup guide and support for web access</p>\r\n<p>Note:<br /> &bull; Web-based only; no desktop installation required<br /> &bull; Licensed for educational use only, not for commercial projects<br /> &bull; Non-refundable after activation</p>\r\n<p>⸻</p>\r\n<p>Official Website:<br />https://www.sketchup.com/plans-and-pricing/for-education</p>\r\n<p>Access / Login Page:<br />https://edu.sketchup.com/app</p>\r\n<p>This is where users can directly use the web version after login with a valid educational account.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>#shandy</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '{\"SERVICEID\":760,\"SERVICENAME\":\"3) SketchUp EDU for Web - Account + Pass [ 1 Year ]\",\"CREDIT\":\"16.4000\",\"INFO\":\"<p>SketchUp EDU for Web &ndash; Account + Pass [1 Year]<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Servic