(1605, 2, '761', '4) Lumion EDU Account + Pass [ 1 Year ] - All Pro Features ', '3D Rendering Engines / Visualization Tools', 46.9000, '12 - 36 Hours', '<p>Lumion EDU Account + Pass [1 Year] &ndash; All Pro Features</p>\r\n<p>Service Description:<br />Get full access to Lumion EDU for 1 year with all professional features unlocked. This license is specifically designed for students, educators, and academic institutions seeking high-quality, real-time architectural visualization and rendering capabilities.</p>\r\n<p>Included Features:<br /> &bull; Official Lumion EDU license for 1 year<br /> &bull; Access to all Pro-level features available in the commercial version<br /> &bull; Includes:<br /> &bull; Real-time rendering<br /> &bull; Photorealistic skies, lighting, and materials<br /> &bull; Full object library (materials, nature, people, objects, etc.)<br /> &bull; High-quality video and animation export<br /> &bull; Compatible with major 3D software (SketchUp, Revit, Rhino, etc.)<br /> &bull; Works on Windows OS (No Mac version)</p>\r\n<p>Delivery Time:<br /> &bull; EDU license key and download access delivered within 12 to 48 hours</p>\r\n<p>What You Will Receive:<br /> &bull; Valid Lumion EDU license key<br /> &bull; Direct download link to Lumion installer<br /> &bull; Step-by-step activation instructions<br /> &bull; Email-based support for installation if needed</p>\r\n<p>Note:<br /> &bull; Licensed for non-commercial, educational use only<br /> &bull; Requires a Windows PC with a compatible GPU<br /> &bull; Non-refundable after license is activated</p>\r\n<p>⸻</p>\r\n<p>Official Website:<br />https://www.lumion.com/education.html</p>\r\n<p>Download / License Request Page:<br />https://www.lumion.com/academic.html</p>\r\n<p>From there, students and educators can apply for the free EDU version or use your service for faster activation and account setup.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>#shandy</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '{\"SERVICEID\":761,\"SERVICENAME\":\"4) Lumion EDU Account + Pass [ 1 Year ] - All Pro Features \",\"CREDIT\":\"46.9000\",\"INFO\":\"<p>Lumion EDU Account + Pass [1 Year] &ndash; All Pro Features<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Service Description:<br \\/>Get full access to Lumion EDU for 1 year with all professional features unlocked. This license is specifically designed for students, educators, and academic institutions seeking high-quality, real-time architectural visualization and rendering capabilities.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Included Features:<br \\/> &bull; Official Lumion EDU license for 1 year<br \\/> &bull; Access to all Pro-level features available in the commercial version<br \\/> &bull; Includes:<br \\/> &bull; Real-time rendering<br \\/> &bull; Photorealistic skies, lighting, and materials<br \\/> &bull; Full object library (materials, nature, people, objects, etc.)<br \\/> &bull; High-quality video and animation export<br \\/> &bull; Compatible with major 3D software (SketchUp, Revit, Rhino, etc.)<br \\/> &bull; Works on Windows OS (No Mac version)<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Delivery Time:<br \\/> &bull; EDU license key and download access delivered within 12 to 48 hours<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>What You Will Receive:<br \\/> &bull; Valid Lumion EDU license key<br \\/> &bull; Direct download link to Lumion installer<br \\/> &bull; Step-by-step activation instructions<br \\/> &bull; Email-based support for installation if needed<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Note:<br \\/> &bull; Licensed for non-commercial, educational use only<br \\/> &bull; Requires a Windows PC with a compatible GPU<br \\/> &bull; Non-refundable after license is activated<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\u2e3b<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Official Website:<br \\/>https:\\/\\/www.lumion.com\\/education.html<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Download \\/ License Request Page:<br \\/>https:\\/\\/www.lumion.com\\/academic.html<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>From there, students and educators can apply for the free EDU version or use your service for faster activation and account setup.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>#shandy<\\/p>\",\"ADDITIONAL_NVP\":\"a:2: