(1606, 2, '762', '5) Lumion EDU Bind Key [ 1 Year ] -  All Pro Features ', '3D Rendering Engines / Visualization Tools', 56.9000, '12 - 36 Hours', '<p>Lumion EDU Bind Key [1 Year] &ndash; All Pro Features</p>\r\n<p>Service Description:<br />Get a 1-year Lumion EDU Bind Key that unlocks all Pro features for educational use. This license is ideal for students and educators who want to activate Lumion on their own account with full access to high-end architectural visualization tools.</p>\r\n<p>Included Features:<br /> &bull; Official Lumion EDU Bind Key valid for 1 year<br /> &bull; Unlocks all Pro features, including:<br /> &bull; Real-time photorealistic rendering<br /> &bull; Full material, object, and effects libraries<br /> &bull; High-quality image and video output<br /> &bull; Real Sky, 3D Grass, animated objects, lighting, and more<br /> &bull; Compatible with major 3D modeling tools like SketchUp, Revit, Rhino, ArchiCAD<br /> &bull; Educational-use only license (non-commercial)</p>\r\n<p>How It Works:<br /> &bull; You will receive a bind key (activation code)<br /> &bull; You can redeem this key on the official Lumion platform<br /> &bull; It binds the license to your Lumion Account for 1-year access</p>\r\n<p>Delivery Time:<br /> &bull; Bind key and activation instructions delivered within 12 to 36 hours</p>\r\n<p>What You Will Receive:<br /> &bull; 1x Lumion EDU Bind Key (valid for 1 device/account)<br /> &bull; Step-by-step guide for activation<br /> &bull; Installation support if needed</p>\r\n<p>System Requirements:<br /> &bull; Requires Windows PC with high-performance GPU<br /> &bull; Lumion does not support macOS</p>\r\n<p>Note:<br /> &bull; Licensed for educational purposes only, not for commercial or professional use<br /> &bull; Cannot be transferred once activated<br /> &bull; Non-refundable after activation</p>\r\n<p>⸻</p>\r\n<p>Official Website:<br />https://www.lumion.com/education.html</p>\r\n<p>License Activation (Academic Section):<br />http