(1706, 2, '157', '$10 US Google Play Card', 'Gift Cards / Game Cards / Activation Cards', 12.0000, '0-1 Instant', '<p>Notes:<br />- This product is applicable for Google Play US store only. (It is NOT redeemable for Google Play accounts created in other countries than the United States)<br />we are not affiliated, associated, or in any way connected with websites that promise exchanges and/or trades of Google Play codes for other products. No refunds will be deemed applicable nor provided in such cases.</p>\r\n<p>Buy Google Play Gift Card (US) now, the most convenient method to get all your preferred Android apps, videos, books, games and shows all from a single source. Quickly available, direct for your computer or Android device. Best of all, Google Play gift card never expire, so buy your Google Play gift cards online now at our OffGamers store and enjoy your content on both the web and your Android phone or tablet today.</p>\r\n<p>How to Redeem Google Play Gift Card</p>\r\n<p>The ways to redeem a Google Play gift card very straight forward, you start by accessing the Google Play store, then seek out the app or item you want and find a drop down menu that indicate a &ldquo;Redeem&rdquo; payment method option. You&rsquo;ll then see your updated Google Play balance but note there is a capped limit of $2,000.</p>\r\n<p>We do not accept returns or exchanges. Once a gift card leaves our secure inventory, we can no longer guarantee the validity of the code; therefore after an order has been sent we cannot return or exchange it. Please be careful when selecting the card you wish to buy.</p>\r\n<p>We do offer a 100% guarantee that you will receive a valid, and authentic gift code. For any technical issues, our expert support staff will be more than happy to assist you.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '{\"SERVICEID\":157,\"SERVICENAME\":\"$10 US Google Play Card\",\"CREDIT\":\"12.0000\",\"INFO\":\"<p>Notes:<br \\/>- This product is applicable for Google Play US store only. 