(53, NULL, '1-v-ray-edu-account-pass-1-year-all-premium-features', '\"{\\\"en\\\":\\\"1) V-Ray EDU Account + Pass [ 1 Year ] [ All Premium Features ]\\\",\\\"fallback\\\":\\\"1) V-Ray EDU Account + Pass [ 1 Year ] [ All Premium Features ]\\\"}\"', '\"{\\\"en\\\":\\\"12 - 24 Hours\\\",\\\"fallback\\\":\\\"12 - 24 Hours\\\"}\"', '\"{\\\"en\\\":\\\"<p>V-Ray EDU Account + Pass [1 Year] [All Premium Features]<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>Service Description:<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>Get full access to V-Ray EDU&nbsp; for 1 year \\u2014 perfect for those looking for professional-quality rendering tools at a fraction of the cost.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u2e3b<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>Includes:<br> \\u2022 Valid V-Ray EDU Account (Student\\\\\\/Faculty License)<br> \\u2022 1-Year Access to:<br> \\u2022 V-Ray for SketchUp, 3ds Max, Rhino, Revit, Cinema 4D, etc.<br> \\u2022 Chaos Cosmos 3D asset library<br> \\u2022 V-Ray GPU and CPU rendering<br> \\u2022 Integration with Chaos Cloud, Chaos Scans, and Chaos Phoenix<br> \\u2022 All Premium Features included \\u2014 same as the commercial version<br> \\u2022 Fully legal and licensed under Chaos Group\\u2019s Educational Terms<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u2e3b<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>Delivery Time:<br> \\u2022 Account details and activation within 12\\u201324 hours<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>What You\\u2019ll Receive:<br> \\u2022 EDU-verified V-Ray Account (email\\\\\\/password or license key)<br> \\u2022 Activation instructions<br> \\u2022 Full access to V-Ray software and Chaos ecosystem<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>&nbsp;Official Website:<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/www.chaos.com\\\\\\/vray<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>This is the main V-Ray page where you can:<br> \\u2022 Explore versions for SketchUp, 3ds Max, Rhino, Revit, Cinema 4D, Maya, and more<br> \\u2022 View features, pricing, and educational plans<br> \\u2022 Start a free trial<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>Download \\\\\\/ Free Trial Page:<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/www.chaos.com\\\\\\/vray\\\\\\/trial<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>From here you can:<br> \\u2022 Select your platform (e.g., SketchUp, 3ds Max, etc.)<br> \\u2022 Sign in or create a Chaos account<br> \\u2022 Download the installer<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>Download Steps:<br> 1. Go to the download page above<br> 2. Choose your V-Ray version (e.g., V-Ray for SketchUp)<br> 3. Log in or sign up with a Chaos account<br> 4. Download the installer for your OS (Windows\\\\\\/macOS)<br> 5. Follow the installer instructions<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>#shandy<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"fallback\\\":\\\"<p>V-Ray EDU Account + Pass [1 Year] [All Premium Features]<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>Service Description:<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>Get full access to V-Ray EDU&nbsp; for 1 year \\u2014 perfect for those looking for professional-quality rendering tools at a fraction of the cost.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u2e3b<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>Includes:<br> \\u2022 Valid V-Ray EDU Account (Student\\\\\\/Faculty License)<br> \\u2022 1-Year Access to:<br> \\u2022 V-Ray for SketchUp, 3ds Max, Rhino, Revit, Cinema 4D, etc.<br> \\u2022 Chaos Cosmos 3D asset library<br> \\u2022 V-Ray GPU and CPU rendering<br> \\u2022 Integration with Chaos Cloud, Chaos Scans, and Chaos Phoenix<br> \\u2022 All Premium Features included \\u2014 same as the commercial version<br> \\u2022 Fully legal and licensed under Chaos Group\\u2019s Educational Terms<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>\\u2e3b<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>Delivery Time:<br> \\u2022 Account details and activation within 12\\u201324 hours<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>What You\\u2019ll Receive:<br> \\u2022 EDU-verified V-Ray Account (email\\\\\\/password or license key)<br> \\u2022 Activation instructions<br> \\u2022 Full access to V-Ray software and Chaos ecosystem<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>&nbsp;Official Website:<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/www.chaos.com\\\\\\/vray<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>This is the main V-Ray page where you can:<br> \\u2022 Explore vers